var e={"(max-width: 740px)":`（最大宽度：740px）`,"(max-width: 900px)":`（最大宽度：900px）`,"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)":`（首选减少运动：减少）`,"{0} (unavailable)":`{0}(不可用)`,"{0} | CraftBox":`{0} | CraftBox`,"{0} CraftBox release {1}. Browse the release notes and published files.":`{0}CraftBox释放{1}。浏览发行说明和已发布的文件。`,"{0} file":`{0} 个文件`,"{0} files":`{0} 个文件`,"{0} KB":`{0} KB`,"{0} match":`{0} 条结果`,"{0} matches":`{0} 条结果`,"{0} MB":`{0} MB`,"{0} of {1} functions":`共 {1} 项功能，显示 {0} 项`,"{0} release · {1}":`{0} 发布 · {1}`,"`.craftbox` render or cinematic":"`.craftbox` 渲染或电影","`.craftbox` structure":"`.craftbox`结构","`Ctrl+Tab` and `Ctrl+Shift+Tab` switch documents. `Ctrl+W` closes the current document and `Ctrl+Shift+T` reopens the most recently closed document in the current session.":"`Ctrl+Tab` 和 `Ctrl+Shift+Tab` 切换文档。 `Ctrl+W` 关闭当前文档,`Ctrl+Shift+T` 重新打开当前会话中最近关闭的文档。","`list-realms` lists what is available to the selected account.":"`list-realms` 列出了所选帐户可用的内容。","`packs` collects packs offered to an authorized client session.":"`packs` 收集提供给授权客户端会话的包。","`render3d` expects an unpacked Bedrock world directory with its database and an available 3D asset catalog. The command opens the database read-only, loads available world packs, and writes a static GLB.":"`render3d` 需要一个解压的基岩世界目录及其数据库和可用的 3D 资产目录。该命令以只读方式打开数据库,加载可用的世界包,并写入静态GLB。","`scene.gltf` and `scene.bin`; the PNG texture is stored in the buffer.":"`scene.gltf`和`scene.bin`; PNG纹理存储在缓冲区中。","`scene.obj`, `scene.mtl`, plus `atlas.png` and `opacity.png` when textures are enabled.":"`scene.obj`、`scene.mtl`,以及启用纹理时的 `atlas.png` 和 `opacity.png`。","`worlds` captures received world data.":"`worlds` 捕获接收到的世界数据。","0 s":`0 秒`,"2 s":`2 秒`,"3D pack previews":`3D 包预览`,"3D rendering and scene design":`3D渲染和场景设计`,"5 s":`5 秒`,"A backup may open with missing visuals until the receiving installation can resolve the required packs.":`备份打开时可能会缺少视觉效果，直到接收安装可以解析所需的包为止。`,"A backup-only archive is appropriate for preservation if the original dependencies cannot be copied. Keep its dependency report with the backup.":`如果无法复制原始依赖项，则仅备份存档适合保存。将其依赖性报告与备份一起保留。`,"A blueprint can contain known air, unknown terrain, and Structure Void. These distinctions matter when selecting a region, placing it in a world copy, or comparing two captures. Structure Void leaves the destination unchanged when it is used as the export choice for gaps.":`蓝图可以包含已知空气、未知地形和结构虚空。当选择一个区域、将其放置在世界副本中或比较两个捕获时，这些区别很重要。当 Structure Void 用作间隙的导出选择时，目标位置保持不变。`,"A completed visit can open in Render editor. You can also start from an existing Bedrock world.":`完成的访问可以在渲染编辑器中打开。您还可以从现有的基岩世界开始。`,"A cropped world has invalid spawn or dimensions":`裁剪后的世界具有无效的生成或尺寸`,"A full-sphere panorama is a 2:1 image. Choose it for spherical viewing.":`全球全景是 2:1 图像。选择它进行球面观看。`,"A Hive fox model exported to Blockbench with textures and editable hierarchy":`导出到 Blockbench 的 Hive 狐狸模型，具有纹理和可编辑层次结构`,"A Hive Games world framed in CraftBox Render editor":`在 CraftBox 渲染编辑器中构建的 Hive Games 世界`,"A live map and command-line world processing are shared. The Atlas, composition editor, and portable local dependency workflow cover different jobs.":`共享实时地图和命令行世界处理。 Atlas、合成编辑器和可移植的本地依赖项工作流程涵盖了不同的工作。`,"A live map marker can help track your position during capture. Markers have their own display and export behavior.":`实时地图标记可以帮助您在捕捉过程中跟踪您的位置。标记有自己的显示和导出行为。`,"A map or presentation":`地图或演示文稿`,"A map overlay can show where your visit has recorded data and where a region still contains gaps. A clean-looking map at one zoom level can hide gaps near the bounds. Use coverage and coordinates before treating a selection as complete.":`地图叠加层可以显示您的访问记录了数据的位置以及仍存在空白的区域。在某一缩放级别上看起来干净的地图可以隐藏边界附近的间隙。在将选择视为完整之前使用覆盖范围和坐标。`,"A missing preview means the required data was unavailable in the catalog. The listing is still useful for its available details.":`缺少预览意味着所需数据在目录中不可用。该列表因其可用的详细信息而仍然有用。`,"A page with no matches can still have more results to load. Result counts reflect loaded items.":`没有匹配项的页面仍然可以加载更多结果。结果计数反映了已加载的项目。`,"A portable copy in a new directory has its own first-run introduction. CraftBox uses an installation marker in `.craftbox/installation-id` beside the executable. Retaining that directory across an executable update preserves the installation’s introduction state.":"新目录中的可移植副本有其自己的首次运行介绍。 CraftBox 在可执行文件旁边的`.craftbox/installation-id` 中使用安装标记。在可执行更新中保留该目录可以保留安装的引入状态。","A portable studio project contains the data needed by its editor. Finished images and videos remain separate outputs.":`便携式工作室项目包含其编辑器所需的数据。完成的图像和视频保持单独的输出。`,"A published build for your CPU and the desktop runtime dependencies for your distribution. Consult the upstream build notes for GTK and WebKitGTK requirements.":`针对您的 CPU 的已发布版本以及您的发行版的桌面运行时依赖项。请参阅上游构建说明以了解 GTK 和 WebKitGTK 要求。`,"A recognized fatal event was recorded.":`记录了公认的致命事件。`,"A saved visit keeps the terrain the Bedrock client received, along with the capture options and available exports.":`保存的访问会保留基岩客户端收到的地形，以及捕获选项和可用的导出。`,"A selected structure and its supported block data":`选定的结构及其支持的块数据`,"A separate option enables custom entity and model recording.":`单独的选项支持自定义实体和模型记录。`,"A short camera sequence":`简短的镜头序列`,"A source snapshot can establish that a workflow exists. Individual failure cases and output parity need their own evidence.":`源快照可以确定工作流程存在。个别失败案例和产出平价需要它们自己的证据。`,"A static model uses the retained terrain and material data. Its geometry comes from the selected source region independently of camera framing. Store the editable camera and scene settings in a separate `.craftbox` project.":"静态模型使用保留的地形和材质数据。其几何形状来自选定的源区域，与相机取景无关。将可编辑的摄像机和场景设置存储在单独的 `.craftbox` 项目中。","A text log contains less information than a recording with packet bytes. Review privacy redactions before sharing.":`文本日志包含的信息少于数据包字节记录。共享之前查看隐私修订。`,"A transfer or dimension change can create a different visit. Use the visit details instead of relying only on similar world names.":`转移或尺寸更改可以创建不同的访问。使用访问详细信息，而不是仅依赖相似的世界名称。`,"A world export is empty":`世界出口是空的`,About:`关于`,"About CraftBox":`关于CraftBox`,"Accept equivalent source families through address forms and GUI pickers.":`通过地址表单和 GUI 选择器接受等效源系列。`,Active:`活跃`,"Actor JSON utilities":`演员JSON实用程序`,"Add a camera keyframe closer to the island and adjust the path between the two keyframes.":`添加靠近岛屿的相机关键帧，并调整两个关键帧之间的路径。`,"Adjust color, exposure, focus distance, and other image effects.":`调整颜色、曝光、焦距和其他图像效果。`,"Adjust scene shadow appearance and quality.":`调整场景阴影外观和质量。`,"Adjust selection corners numerically and retain named subregions.":`以数字方式调整选择角并保留命名的子区域。`,"Adjust skies, water, clouds, fog, shadows, point lights, and color grading.":`调整天空、水、云、雾、阴影、点光源和颜色分级。`,"Adjust sun, time of day, sky, environment intensity, and related controls.":`调整太阳、一天中的时间、天空、环境强度和相关控制。`,"Adjust the 3D scene’s water appearance and related scene effects.":`调整3D场景的水外观及相关场景效果。`,"Advertised metadata reflects the connected session. Command availability follows that server and account.":`通告的元数据反映了连接的会话。命令可用性取决于服务器和帐户。`,All:`全部`,"All categories":`所有类别`,"All CraftBox guides, workflows, and reference articles":`所有 CraftBox 指南、工作流程和参考文章`,"All downloads":`所有下载`,"All features":`所有功能`,"All guides":`所有指南`,"All platforms":`所有平台`,"All results":`所有结果`,"All variants":`所有类型`,"An editor saves the data it owns. Choose a project from the appropriate workspace and check whether you need to retain any optional dependencies.":`编辑器保存它拥有的数据。从适当的工作区中选择一个项目，然后检查是否需要保留任何可选的依赖项。

当您想要离线处理时，可以提供`,"An existing supported `.pcap2` recording can be supplied as the world command’s address when you want offline processing. The installed codec and the recording’s retained data determine the available result.":"现有支持的`.pcap2`记录作为世界命令的地址。安装的编解码器和录音的保留数据决定了可用的结果。","An export stalls or a format is unavailable":`导出停止或格式不可用`,"An extraction creates independent blueprint data.":`提取会创建独立的蓝图数据。`,"An independent, open-source desktop app and CLI for Minecraft Bedrock worlds.":`一个独立的开源桌面应用程序和CLI 用于Minecraft Bedrock 世界。`,"An item may appear through a published store, collection, or supported creator association.":`项目可能会通过已发布的商店、集合或支持的创建者协会出现。`,"An older project opens without Atlas or pack inspection":`较旧的项目在没有 Atlas 或包检查的情况下打开`,"An ordinary PNG render and map-art tiles represent different data. A world can produce a terrain map and contain no recorded item-frame maps.":`普通的 PNG 渲染和地图艺术图块代表不同的数据。世界可以生成地形图并且不包含记录的物品框架地图。`,"An unknown blueprint cell blocks direct placement into a world. World placement writes a new .mcworld and preserves the source world.":`未知的蓝图单元阻止直接放置到世界中。世界放置写入新的 .mcworld 并保留源世界。`,"An unknown price is shown as unknown. Treat it differently from an offer with explicit free pricing.":`未知价格显示为未知。对待它与明确免费定价的报价不同。`,"An updater is present. No equivalent studio channel-preference workflow was identified.":`存在更新程序。没有确定等效的工作室频道偏好工作流程。`,"Android application":`Android 应用程序`,"Android build tooling exists in the source. The desktop release workflow targets Windows, Linux, and macOS.":`Android 构建工具存在于源代码中。桌面发布工作流程面向 Windows、Linux 和 macOS。`,"Animate camera position, target, lens, roll, exposure, or focus on the timeline.":`在时间轴上对摄像机位置、目标、镜头、滚动、曝光或焦点进行动画处理。`,"Annotate observations and isolate a portion of a saved session.":`注释观察结果并隔离已保存会话的一部分。`,"Annotated map PNG":`注释地图PNG`,"Annotated PNG":`注释PNG`,"Apple Silicon":`Apple Silicon`,"Apply biome colors, terrain relief, and depth-aware water to the top-down result.":`将生物群落颜色、地形起伏和深度感知水应用到自上而下的结果中。`,"Approach the subject":`接近主题`,"ARM (32-bit)":`ARM (32-bit)`,ARM64:`ARM64`,"Arrange audio clips for a preview session.":`安排预览会话的音频剪辑。`,"Arrange clips across tracks for an audition with multiple sounds.":`在轨道上排列剪辑，以进行多种声音的试听。`,"Arrange shots, inspect paths, and preview interpolated camera motion.":`安排镜头、检查路径并预览插值摄像机运动。`,"Arrange supported audio for cinematic playback and export.":`排列支持的音频以进行电影播放和导出。`,"Arrange up to 16 regions with X/Y/Z offsets, snapping, and overlap review.":`通过 X/Y/Z 偏移、捕捉和重叠查看来排列最多 16 个区域。`,"Artifact labels and release files in Downloads.":`下载中的工件标签和发布文件。`,"Ask the account holder to opt in, opt out, or cancel when required and retry after an answer.":`要求账户持有人在需要时选择加入、选择退出或取消，并在答复后重试。`,"Asset previews":`资源预览`,"Atlas inspection":`图集检查`,"Atlas preferences and annotations can be carried in studio projects. A project saved with geometry only can retain the Rendered map even when raw Atlas data is unavailable.":`Atlas首选项和注释可以在工作室项目中携带。即使原始 Atlas 数据不可用，仅使用几何体保存的项目也可以保留渲染地图。`,"Atomic output replacement":`原子输出替换`,"Audio on a video timeline":`视频时间轴上的音频`,"Audio Studio":`Audio Studio`,"Audio Studio arrangements are designed for listening previews.":`Audio Studio 编排是为试听而设计的。`,"Audio Studio can show a pack sound’s waveform and arrange several clips for listening. Use it for previewing the pack’s audio; the reviewed workflow does not save a mixed audio project or export a mix.":`Audio Studio可以显示包声音的波形并排列多个片段进行聆听。用它来预览包的音频；审核后的工作流程不会保存混合音频项目或导出混音。`,"Audio Studio previews arrangements during the session. Mixed-track export and portable audio projects are unavailable.":`Audio Studio 预览会议期间的安排。混合曲目导出和便携式音频项目不可用。`,"Audio Studio previews clips. The cinematic audio workflow is separate.":`Audio Studio 预览剪辑。电影音频工作流程是独立的。`,Automatic:`自动`,"Automatic scene direction":`自动场景方向`,"Availability depends on the selected source. Offline favorites keep identifiers and resolve when the catalog is reachable again.":`可用性取决于所选来源。脱机收藏夹会保留标识符，并在再次可以访问目录时进行解析。`,Available:`可用`,"Available evidence":`现有证据`,"Available source animation channels and controllers can be carried into supported editable projects. The exported project cannot reconstruct missing data or supply the original Minecraft runtime.":`可用的源动画通道和控制器可以导入到支持的可编辑项目中。导出的项目无法重建丢失的数据或提供原始的Minecraft运行时。`,"Backup only creates a copy of the available files and a dependency report when a complete world export is blocked. Use the report to identify missing items. Keep any protected packs and entitlement information with their original installation.":`当完整的世界导出被阻止时，备份仅创建可用文件的副本和依赖关系报告。使用该报告来识别丢失的物品。保留所有受保护的包和权利信息及其原始安装。`,"Baked asset geometry":`烘焙资产几何体`,"Bedrock Block":`基岩块`,"Bedrock connection sources":`基岩连接源`,"Bedrock Entity":`基岩实体`,"bedrocktool extension":`bedrocktool 扩展`,"Before rotating or mirroring, address any unknown direction state called out by the transform dialog. Review state orientation after the transform.":`在旋转或镜像之前，解决变换对话框调用的任何未知方向状态。检查变换后的状态方向。`,Behavior:`行为`,"Biome and height shading":`生物群落和高度阴影`,Biomes:`生物群系`,"Block palette and state editing":`块调色板和状态编辑`,"Blockbench workflow and example":`Blockbench 工作流程和示例`,"Blueprint and world export":`蓝图与世界输出`,"Blueprint documents":`蓝图文档`,"Blueprint revision comparison":`蓝图改版对比`,Blueprints:`蓝图`,"Bookmarks and clips":`书签和剪辑`,"Both projects can make top-down maps. The CraftBox renderer also builds a navigable scene from retained source terrain.":`这两个项目都可以制作自上而下的地图。 CraftBox 渲染器还根据保留的源地形构建可导航场景。`,"Both projects inherit a capture-first workflow. Options, defaults, and the controls around a saved visit differ.":`两个项目都继承了捕获优先的工作流程。已保存访问的选项、默认值和控件有所不同。`,"Bring a world into CraftBox, then use the same terrain for a map, blueprint, render, or cinematic.":`将世界带入CraftBox，然后将相同的地形用于地图、蓝图、渲染或过场动画。`,"Browse assets, inspect their source data, and take supported models into other editors.":`浏览资产，检查其源数据，并将支持的模型放入其他编辑器中。`,"Browse catalog offers and collections associated with supported featured servers and Experiences.":`浏览与受支持的特色服务器和体验相关的目录优惠和集合。`,"Browse categories":`浏览类别`,"Browse Marketplace offers":`浏览市场优惠`,"Browse offers and collections":`浏览优惠和系列`,"Browse online catalog data and export supported offer metadata.":`浏览在线目录数据并导出支持的商品元数据。`,"Browse original files, textures, geometry bindings, and available previews.":`浏览原始文件、纹理、几何绑定和可用预览。`,"Browse persistent recording entries with capture state and metadata.":`浏览带有捕获状态和元数据的持久记录条目。`,"Browse published stable and preview CraftBox release notes.":`浏览已发布的稳定版和预览版 CraftBox 发行说明。`,"Browse published stable and preview releases from GitHub.":`浏览GitHub 发布的稳定版和预览版。`,"Browse release notes":`浏览发行说明`,"Browse saved visits, check capture coverage, and export or import a world copy.":`浏览保存的访问，检查捕获范围，以及导出或导入世界副本。`,"Browse scoped offers in a searchable grid or list with filters.":`在可搜索网格或带有过滤器的列表中浏览范围优惠。`,"Browse snapshots from supported Minecraft sources and track how files or identifiers change across builds.":`从受支持的 Minecraft 源浏览快照，并跟踪文件或标识符在构建过程中的变化情况。`,"Browse supported servers, Realms, Experiences, and Xbox friend sessions, or enter an address.":`浏览支持的服务器、领域、体验和 Xbox 好友会话，或输入地址。`,"Browse the changelog":`查看更新日志`,"Browse the command metadata advertised by a connected server and inspect the desktop console history.":`浏览连接的服务器通告的命令元数据并检查桌面控制台历史记录。`,"Browse the CraftBox code, follow changes between releases, or contribute on GitHub.":`浏览 CraftBox 代码，跟踪版本之间的更改，或为 GitHub 做出贡献。`,"Browse the desktop workspaces and command-line tools":`浏览桌面工作区和命令行工具`,"Browse the docs":`浏览文档`,Build:`构建`,"Build a camera move":`构建相机移动`,"Build a textured scene from a captured or local world.":`从捕获的或本地的世界构建纹理场景。`,"Build by layers, compare revisions, count materials, and export to Bedrock or a portable project.":`分层构建、比较修订、计算材料并导出到基岩或便携式项目。`,"Build requirements":`构建要求`,"Bulk editing and transforms":`批量编辑和转换`,"Bundle a scene and its settings using the data needed for the intended workflow.":`使用预期工作流程所需的数据捆绑场景及其设置。`,"Bundle editable render or sequence data in .craftbox with optional retained source terrain.":`将 .craftbox 中的可编辑渲染或序列数据与可选的保留源地形捆绑在一起。`,"Camera keyframes":`相机关键帧`,"Camera navigation":`相机导航`,"Cancellation and validation errors discard the incomplete output. The source is opened read-only.":`取消和验证错误会丢弃不完整的输出。源以只读方式打开。`,"Cancelling the initial sign-in leaves the introduction pending. Continue offline explicitly if this session only needs local tools.":`取消初始登录会使介绍挂起。如果此会话仅需要本地工具，则显式继续离线。`,"Capture a Bedrock session, copy a local world, or compose a new world from saved regions.":`捕获基岩会话、复制本地世界或从​​已保存的区域组成新世界。`,"Capture a Discovery source":`捕获发现源`,"Capture a session":`捕获会话`,"Capture a world":`捕获世界`,"Capture a world. Create something with it.":`捕获世界，开启创作。`,"Capture a world. Create something with it. Make maps, blueprints, renders, and cinematics with the open-source Minecraft Bedrock desktop studio.":`占领一个世界。用它创造一些东西。使用开源 Minecraft Bedrock 桌面工作室制作地图、蓝图、渲染和动画。`,"Capture coverage":`捕获覆盖范围`,"Capture creates raw assets in both projects. CraftBox adds tools for organizing, inspecting, editing, and exporting them.":`Capture 在两个项目中创建原始资产。 CraftBox 添加了用于组织、检查、编辑和导出它们的工具。`,"Capture from the terminal":`从终端捕获`,"Capture is bounded by terrain and data delivered to the client.":`捕获受到地形和传递给客户端的数据的限制。`,"Capture Minecraft Bedrock worlds and turn them into maps, editable blueprints, renders, and cinematics.":`捕获 Minecraft Bedrock 世界并将其转换为地图、可编辑蓝图、渲染图和动画。`,"Capture observed player skins with options for name filtering and texture-only output.":`使用名称过滤和仅纹理输出选项捕获观察到的玩家皮肤。`,"Capture option definitions":`捕获选项定义`,"Capture options":`捕捉选项`,"Capture radius controls the request. It serves a different purpose from an interactive export selection.":`捕获半径控制请求。它的用途与交互式导出选择不同。`,"Capture received data from a compatible Bedrock session. Export a .mcworld and, when enabled, a PNG map or recording.":`捕获从兼容的 Bedrock 会话接收到的数据。导出 .mcworld 以及（启用后）PNG 地图或记录。`,"Captured files can be exported for use outside the app.":`捕获的文件可以导出以在应用程序外部使用。`,"Captured signs in a 3D export":`在 3D 导出中捕获的标志`,"Carry supported source animation channels and controller definitions into editable output.":`将支持的源动画通道和控制器定义携带到可编辑输出中。`,"Catalog favorites":`目录最爱`,"Catalog metadata export omits recognized credentials and signed content URLs. Review an export before sharing it.":`目录元数据导出忽略已识别的凭据和签名的内容 URL。在共享之前查看导出内容。`,Category:`类别`,"CC BY 4.0":`CC 4.0`,"Center the Atlas on a fixed landmark and enable coverage.":`将 Atlas 置于固定地标中心并启用覆盖。`,"Changed or misoriented":`改变或迷失方向`,Changelog:`更新日志`,Channel:`渠道`,"Chat logs and Realm listing":`聊天记录和领域列表`,Check:`检查`,"Check a short export at the intended frame rate and output size before rendering the whole sequence.":`在渲染整个序列之前,以预期的帧速率和输出大小检查简短的导出。`,"Check account and platform requirements separately":`分别检查账户和平台要求`,"Check before installing":`安装前检查`,"Check before running":`运行前检查`,"Check command options":`检查命令选项`,"Check first":`先检查一下`,"Check how a block changed":`检查区块如何变化`,"Check resource and behavior pack versions, nested dependencies, and unreadable data.":`检查资源和行为包版本、嵌套依赖项以及不可读的数据。`,"Check that the selected region includes at least one source chunk and that the destination dimension fits the terrain height.":`检查所选区域是否至少包含一个源块,并且目标尺寸是否适合地形高度。`,"Check the address and port displayed by CraftBox against the values entered in Minecraft.":`检查CraftBox 显示的地址和端口与Minecraft 中输入的值。`,"Check the archive on the receiving device":`检查接收设备上的存档`,"Check the biome IDs or names recorded for an area.":`检查某个区域记录的生物群系 ID 或名称。`,"Check the camera path and the visible edges of the region at the first, middle, and last frames.":`检查相机路径以及第一帧、中间帧和最后一帧区域的可见边缘。`,"Check the coordinates and coverage counts.":`检查坐标和覆盖范围计数。`,"Check the displayed price context, creator, compatibility, and available gallery assets.":`检查显示的价格背景、创建者、兼容性和可用的图库资产。`,"Check the input before running render3d":`在运行 render3d 之前检查输入`,"Check the installed release, Bedrock version, and NetherNet compatibility of the source.":`检查已安装的版本、基岩版本和NetherNet 源的兼容性。`,"Check the last event. An interrupted exit may have no crash stack.":`查看最后一个事件。中断的退出可能没有崩溃堆栈。`,"Check the material list":`查看材料清单`,"Check the named region’s chunk counts and review the edges and dimension.":`检查指定区域的块计数并检查边缘和尺寸。`,"Check the notes for the exact release. Minecraft protocol support and the shipped features can change between versions.":`检查注释以了解确切的版本。 Minecraft 协议支持和附带的功能可能会因版本而异。`,"Check the pack messages, exact dependency versions, and whether the relevant definitions were supplied. Revisit the original capture or local source when available.":`检查包消息、确切的依赖版本以及是否提供了相关定义。重新访问原始捕获或本地源(如果可用)。`,"Check the preview’s missing or unsupported binding warnings. Identify whether geometry, its material alias, or its texture is missing.":`检查预览缺少或不支持的绑定警告。确定几何体、其材质别名或其纹理是否丢失。`,"Check the result":`查看结果`,"Check the result before sharing":`分享前检查结果`,"Check the saved visit and the asset library for observed content. Enable relevant capture options before the visit.":`检查已保存的访问和资产库中观察到的内容。在访问之前启用相关的捕获选项。`,"Check the source and the local endpoint shown in the desktop workspace before joining from Minecraft.":`从 Minecraft 加入之前,请检查桌面工作区中显示的源和本地端点。`,"Check transport and platform compatibility":`检查传输和平台兼容性`,"Check what the preview and export contain":`检查预览和导出包含哪些内容`,"Check what was retained when the project was saved. A prepared-geometry project can still render successfully while the raw world needed for Atlas, pack changes, and some source-bound operations is absent.":`检查保存工程时保留的内容。当 Atlas、包更改和一些源绑定操作所需的原始世界不存在时,准备好的几何体项目仍然可以成功渲染。`,"Check world and pack fidelity":`检查世界和包装保真度`,"Check your release, Minecraft client and source, desktop runtime, and required asset data.":`检查您的版本、Minecraft 客户端和源、桌面运行时以及所需的资产数据。`,"Checksum for {0}":`{0} 的校验和`,"Choose a Blockbench target":`选择Blockbench目标`,"Choose a bound object and extract selected model parts for export.":`选择绑定对象并提取选定的模型零件以进行导出。`,"Choose a build":`选择构建版本`,"Choose a CraftBox workflow":`选择CraftBox 工作流程`,"Choose a desktop build":`选择桌面版本`,"Choose a destination":`选择目的地`,"Choose a download version":`选择下载版本`,"Choose a file format":`选择文件格式`,"Choose a format for the completed map":`选择已完成地图的格式`,"Choose a format for your world, project, or export.":`为您的世界、项目或导出选择一种格式。`,"Choose a keyframe":`选择关键帧`,"Choose a macOS build":`选择 macOS 版本`,"Choose a preset and save edited settings as a look.":`选择预设并将编辑的设置保存为外观。`,"Choose a project instead of an export":`选择项目而不是导出`,"Choose a published build":`选择已发布的版本`,"Choose a published CLI build. Inputs and outputs vary by command and include world folders, images, and static models.":`选择已发布的 CLI 版本。输入和输出因命令而异,包括世界文件夹、图像和静态模型。`,"Choose a published executable by operating system, variant, and CPU. The website shows the detected system when a matching published Desktop artifact is available. The complete download list retains manual selectors.":`按操作系统、变体和 CPU 选择已发布的可执行文件。当匹配的已发布桌面工件可用时,网站会显示检测到的系统。完整的下载列表保留手动选择器。`,"Choose a separate destination and keep the original until the receiving device opens the copy.":`选择单独的目的地并保留原件,直到接收设备打开副本。`,"Choose a source":`选择来源`,"Choose a source you are authorized to use. Read its rules before starting a proxy session.":`选择您有权使用的来源。在启动代理会话之前阅读其规则。`,"Choose a source, record a visit, and understand exactly what goes into a saved Bedrock world.":`选择来源、记录访问并准确了解已保存的基岩世界中的内容。`,"Choose a static model format separately when you only need displayed geometry.":`当您只需要显示几何体时,单独选择静态模型格式。`,"Choose a static model instead":`选择静态模型`,"Choose a supported encoder, frame rate, resolution, and timeline range. GIF carries frames without audio.":`选择支持的编码器、帧速率、分辨率和时间线范围。 GIF 携带没有音频的帧。`,"Choose a supported source such as a custom address, Realm, or available Discovery source.":`选择受支持的源,例如自定义地址、领域或可用的发现源。`,"Choose an additional export":`选择附加导出`,"Choose an available Discovery source and filter offers or open a collection.":`选择可用的发现源并过滤优惠或打开集合。`,"Choose an available MP4, WebM, MOV, MKV, or GIF output. Confirm the timeline range and frame rate, then use video settings such as bitrate and audio where supported. GIF output is silent and has its own frame and pixel budget.":`选择可用的 MP4、WebM、MOV、MKV 或 GIF 输出。确认时间线范围和帧速率,然后使用支持的视频设置,例如比特率和音频。 GIF 输出是无声的,并且有自己的帧和像素预算。`,"Choose an output by what needs to survive the export, from rendered pixels to static source geometry.":`根据导出后需要的内容选择输出,从渲染像素到静态源几何体。`,"Choose Blockbench project · Editable and leave detection automatic unless you know the target format. Open the resulting `.bbmodel` in Blockbench. Supported source geometry preserves hierarchy, bones, pivots, UVs, and available embedded textures.":"选择Blockbench 项目 · 可编辑并自动离开检测,除非您知道目标格式。在Blockbench中打开生成的`.bbmodel`。支持的源几何体保留层次结构、骨骼、枢轴、UV 和可用的嵌入纹理。","Choose entity and inventory recording. The native world command defaults entity capture off.":`选择实体和库存记录。本机世界命令默认实体捕获关闭。`,"Choose from PNG, JPEG, WebP, TIFF, or BMP where offered. The image export shows the exact dimensions and available alpha and quality options. Use PNG for a predictable lossless still with transparency when the workflow supports it.":`从PNG、JPEG、WebP、TIFF 或 BMP(如果提供)中进行选择。图像导出显示确切的尺寸以及可用的 Alpha 和质量选项。当工作流程支持时,使用 PNG 可获得具有透明度的可预测无损静态图像。`,"Choose how editable your handoff needs to be":`选择您的交接需要的可编辑程度`,"Choose image export for a finished still. Save a project when you need the scene to remain editable.":`选择导出完成的静态图像。当您需要场景保持可编辑状态时,保存项目。`,"Choose it to":`选择它`,"Choose selection, detail, transparency, and annotations for an Atlas export.":`选择图集导出的选择、细节、透明度和注释。`,"Choose the best available matching source file or pack. Verify the result in both the preview and the receiving editor.":`选择最佳的可用匹配源文件或包。在预览和接收编辑器中验证结果。`,"Choose the copy you want to produce":`选择您要制作的副本`,"Choose the output":`选择输出`,"Choose the right recording":`选择正确的录音`,"Choose the whole map or the current selection. Set pixel density, texture detail, annotations, and transparency. The dialog reports output dimensions before export. The current Atlas fitting budget is 64 megapixels with a maximum side of 16,384 pixels.":`选择整个地图或当前选择。设置像素密度、纹理细节、注释和透明度。该对话框报告导出前的输出尺寸。目前Atlas的适配预算为64兆像素,最大边长为16,384像素。`,"Choose void, flat, or normal generation for uncaptured terrain.":`为未占领的地形选择虚空、平坦或正常生成。`,"Choose website language":`选择网站语言`,"Choose where the result goes":`选择结果的去向`,"Choose whether to retain available source data when later Atlas access or model export matters.":`选择在以后的 Atlas 访问或模型导出很重要时是否保留可用的源数据。`,"Choose whether to retain source terrain. Geometry-only storage restricts some Atlas and world operations.":`选择是否保留源地形。仅几何存储限制了某些 Atlas 和世界操作。`,"Choose which optional data to retain, including supported entities, inventory, packs, or recordings.":`选择要保留的可选数据,包括支持的实体、库存、包或记录。`,"Choosing a model handoff":`选择模型切换`,Cinematic:`电影`,"Cinematic editor":`电影编辑器`,"Cinematic navigation":`影院式导航`,"Cinematics and media export":`动画和媒体导出`,"Clean exit":`干净退出`,"Cleanly closed":`干净地关闭`,CLI:`CLI`,"CLI and GUI logging are available independently.":`CLI 和 GUI 日志记录可独立使用。`,"CLI local-world renderer":`CLI 本地世界渲染器`,"CLI outputs and common checks":`CLI 输出和常见检查`,"CLI quickstart":`CLI 快速入门`,"CLI textured GLB":`CLI 纹理 GLB`,"CLI world merge":`CLI 世界合并`,Close:`关闭`,"Close a polygon to measure area.":`闭合多边形以测量面积。`,"Close menu":`关闭菜单`,"Close search":`关闭搜索`,"Close suggestions or leave history search.":`关闭建议或留下历史搜索。`,"Close the selected world in Minecraft. In the Worlds header, choose Copy singleplayer world and select the discovered world. You can also point CraftBox at the world directory, a `minecraftWorlds` folder, or a `com.mojang` folder.":"关闭Minecraft中选定的世界。在世界标题中,选择复制单人世界并选择发现的世界。您还可以将 CraftBox 指向世界目录、`minecraftWorlds` 文件夹或 `com.mojang` 文件夹。","Collect available resource packs, browse their files, and inspect supported textures and block or entity models.":`收集可用的资源包,浏览其文件,并检查支持的纹理和块或实体模型。`,"Collect available server resource packs and inspect saved items in the desktop library.":`收集可用的服务器资源包并检查桌面库中保存的项目。`,"Collect other players as models when explicitly enabled.":`明确启用时收集其他玩家作为模型。`,"Collect selected actors and available custom client definitions.":`收集选定的参与者和可用的自定义客户端定义。`,"Collections and creator scope":`收藏品和创作者范围`,"Combining compatible copies":`合并兼容副本`,Command:`命令`,"Command Explorer":`Command Explorer`,"Command Explorer & console":`Command Explorer & 控制台`,"Command options vary by version and platform. Confirm the flags with help from the installed executable.":`命令选项因版本和平台而异。在已安装的可执行文件的帮助下确认标志。`,"Command-line builds support interactive command selection and per-command flags.":`命令行构建支持交互式命令选择和每个命令标志。`,"Command-line tools":`命令行工具`,"Common editing tasks":`常见编辑任务`,"Common scene decisions":`常见场景决策`,Compare:`对比`,"Compare added, removed, and changed files and named identifiers.":`比较添加、删除和更改的文件以及命名标识符。`,"Compare and export offers":`比较并导出报价`,"Compare available decoded observations, retaining numeric precision and marking incomplete data.":`比较可用的解码观测值,保留数字精度并标记不完整的数据。`,"Compare available output formats":`比较可用的输出格式`,"Compare capture, world processing, creative workspaces, export formats, and diagnostics one function at a time.":`一次比较捕捉、世界处理、创意工作区、导出格式和诊断功能。`,"Compare CraftBox and bedrocktool function by function using reviewed source revisions.":`使用已审阅的源修订版逐个功能比较 CraftBox 和 bedrocktool。`,"Compare editable and static files":`比较可编辑文件和静态文件`,"Compare image, model, and video formats":`比较图像、模型和视频格式`,"Compare lets you align two blueprints with an offset and filter missing, extra, different, and incorrectly oriented blocks. Uncaptured cells remain unknown. The translucent comparison view is part of Structure Studio.":`比较可以让您对齐两个具有偏移量的蓝图,并过滤缺失、多余、不同和方向错误的块。未捕获的细胞仍然未知。半透明的比较视图是Structure Studio的一部分。`,"Compare occupied cells and verify that both revisions are aligned to the same anchor.":`比较占用的单元格并验证两个修订是否与同一锚点对齐。`,"Compare output":`比较输出`,"Compare project and export formats":`比较项目和导出格式`,"Compare project storage choices":`比较项目存储选择`,"Compare published builds":`比较已发布的版本`,"Compare recordings and prepare a narrowly scoped, redacted excerpt for support.":`比较录音并准备范围狭窄、经过编辑的摘录以获取支持。`,"Compare rendered and static export settings":`比较渲染和静态导出设置`,"Compare revisions on a large build":`比较大型构建的修订版本`,"Compare supported metadata and export JSON or CSV.":`比较支持的元数据并导出JSON 或 CSV。`,"Compare the live map with actual capture coverage":`比较实时地图与实际捕获覆盖范围`,"Compare the missing or incompatible entry with the installation where the world last opened correctly.":`将丢失或不兼容的条目与世界上次正确打开的安装进行比较。`,"Compare the reported chunk coverage with the route you travelled. Fly or walk back through gaps before stopping.":`将报告的区块覆盖范围与您行驶的路线进行比较。在停下来之前,通过间隙飞行或步行返回。`,"Compare two recorded observations":`比较两个记录的观察结果`,"Compare two snapshots by file, identifier, or decoded contents.":`按文件、标识符或解码内容比较两个快照。`,"Compare two structures for added, removed, different, or reoriented blocks and export material counts.":`比较两个结构的添加、删除、不同或重新定向块并导出材料计数。`,"Compare two versions. Structure Studio distinguishes missing and extra blocks, different materials, and changed orientations.":`比较两个版本。 Structure Studio 区分缺失和多余的块、不同的材料以及改变的方向。`,"Comparison categories":`比较类别`,"Comparison retains full numeric identifiers and separates scalar and container data. Large decoded comparisons are bounded, so a truncated result can be partial.":`比较保留完整的数字标识符并分离标量和容器数据。大型解码比较是有限的,因此截断的结果可能是部分的。`,Compatibility:`兼容性

如果源需要,`,"Complete device-code sign-in through CraftBox Desktop if the source requires it.":`通过CraftBox 桌面完成设备代码登录。`,"Compose a wide shot to keep the terrain, architecture, and water in view.":`构图以保持地形、建筑和水域的视野。`,"Compose more than one world":`组成多个世界`,"Compose regions with offsets, preview overlaps, and save a new Bedrock world.":`使用偏移组合区域、预览重叠并保存新的基岩世界。`,"Confirm filesystem access and reread the world after adding the exact pack through the supported installation workflow.":`通过支持的安装工作流程添加确切的包后,确认文件系统访问并重新读取世界。`,"Confirm Minecraft connected through CraftBox, selected the intended source, and received terrain. Check the live map or coverage view, then revisit the missing area before ending the capture. An empty recorded visit creates no world archive.":`确认Minecraft通过CraftBox连接,选择目标源,接收地形。检查实时地图或覆盖视图,然后在结束捕获之前重新访问缺失的区域。空的访问记录不会创建世界档案。`,"Confirm source coverage in the Atlas":`确认图集中的源覆盖范围`,"Confirm that you selected the intended world.":`确认您选择了预期的世界。`,"Confirm the folder or archive is supported and check the expected dimension and packs.":`确认支持该文件夹或存档并检查预期的尺寸和包。`,"Confirm the input exists and that the requested dimension contains terrain.":`确认输入存在并且请求的维度包含地形。`,"Confirm the world folder is unpacked and the asset catalog is present. Export a smaller region if the selected dimension exceeds the reviewed 4,096-chunk limit.":`确认世界文件夹已解压并且资产目录存在。如果所选维度超过审查的 4,096 块限制,则导出较小的区域。`,"Connect Minecraft using the local address and port displayed by CraftBox. Move through the area you want to save. Check capture coverage before leaving: CraftBox saves the chunks the client receives while it is connected.":`使用CraftBox 显示的本地地址和端口连接Minecraft。穿过要保存的区域。在离开之前检查捕获覆盖率:CraftBox保存客户端在连接时接收到的数据块。`,"Connection details":`连接详情`,"Console keyboard controls":`控制台键盘控制`,"Contents of model transfers":`模型转移内容`,"Continue a render, cinematic, or blueprint later.":`稍后继续渲染、电影或蓝图。`,"Continuing a still or cinematic":`继续静态或电影`,Contours:`轮廓`,"Contribute or report a problem":`贡献或报告问题`,Copied:`已复制`,"Copied.":`已复制。`,"Copy a command":`复制命令`,"Copy a reviewed excerpt to the report. Keep full local archives private.":`将审阅的摘录复制到报告中。将完整的本地档案保密。`,"Copy a singleplayer world":`复制单人游戏世界`,"Copy command for {0}":`{0} 的复制命令`,"Copy failed.":`复制失败。`,"Could not switch language.":`无法切换语言。`,"Count blocks and estimated items per structure, selection, or layer and export CSV.":`计算每个结构、选择或图层的块和估计项目并导出 CSV。`,"Count materials and compare revisions":`清点材料并比较修改`,Coverage:`覆盖范围`,CraftBox:`CraftBox`,"CraftBox - Bedrock Edition":`CraftBox - 基岩版`,"CRAFTBOX - BEDROCK EDITION":`CRAFTBOX - 基岩版`,"CraftBox builds on bedrocktool’s original capture and proxy work. This comparison uses pinned source revisions and records the scope of each workflow. Published builds and live server compatibility can differ.":`CraftBox 建立在bedrocktool 的原始捕获和代理工作之上。此比较使用固定源修订并记录每个工作流程的范围。已发布的版本和实时服务器兼容性可能有所不同。`,"CraftBox contribution guide":`CraftBox 贡献指南

即使您选择离线登录,`,"CraftBox Desktop":`CraftBox 桌面`,"CraftBox desktop starts with local capabilities even if you choose offline onboarding. Windows desktop depends on WebView2. Linux desktop uses GTK and WebKitGTK. macOS desktop uses the system WebKit, with separate Apple Silicon and Intel builds. CLI artifacts run in a terminal.":`CraftBox 桌面也会以本地功能启动。 Windows 桌面依赖于WebView2。 Linux 桌面使用 GTK 和 WebKitGTK。 macOS 桌面使用系统 WebKit,具有单独的 Apple Silicon 和 Intel 版本。 CLI 工件在终端中运行。`,"CraftBox desktop walkthrough":`CraftBox 桌面演练`,"CraftBox documentation":`CraftBox 文档`,"CraftBox extension":`CraftBox 扩展`,"CraftBox features":`CraftBox 特点`,"CraftBox home":`CraftBox 首页`,"CraftBox is distributed under":`CraftBox 分布在`,"CraftBox is independent of Mojang and Microsoft.":`CraftBox 独立于 Mojang 和 Microsoft。`,"CraftBox is independent of Mojang and Microsoft. Minecraft and other third-party names and assets belong to their respective owners.":`CraftBox 独立于 Mojang 和 Microsoft。 Minecraft和其他第三方名称和资产属于其各自所有者。`,"CraftBox is maintained by SpindexGFX and builds on":`CraftBox 由 SpindexGFX 维护并构建于`,"CraftBox Marketplace showing catalog offers and a source list":`CraftBox 显示目录报价和来源列表的市场`,"CraftBox over the Hive Games island. Capture a world. Create something with it.":`CraftBox Hive Games 岛上空。捕捉一个世界。用它创造一些东西。`,"CraftBox preview for {0}":`CraftBox {0} 预览`,"CraftBox Render editor with an aerial view of a Hive Games world":`CraftBox 具有 Hive Games 世界鸟瞰图的渲染编辑器`,"CraftBox resource pack preview showing a model in the desktop library":`CraftBox 资源包预览显示桌面库中的模型`,"CraftBox saves both self-contained studio documents and library workspace state. Choose the file type based on whether the recipient has the same local asset or recording library.":`CraftBox 保存独立的工作室文档和库工作区状态。根据收件人是否具有相同的本地资产或录音库来选择文件类型。`,"CraftBox skin preview with a captured model and clothing controls":`CraftBox 带有捕获的模型和服装控件的皮肤预览`,"CraftBox Structure Studio showing a fountain blueprint":`CraftBox Structure Studio 展示喷泉蓝图`,"CraftBox vs. bedrocktool":`CraftBox 与 bedrocktool`,"CraftBox Worlds showing a saved CubeCraft Games visit and its export actions":`CraftBox 显示保存的 CubeCraft Games 访问及其导出操作的世界`,"CraftBox Worlds with a saved CubeCraft visit":`CraftBox 已保存 CubeCraft 访问的世界`,Crashed:`坠毁`,"Create a blank blueprint, open .mcstructure, or extract a region from a world.":`创建空白蓝图、打开 .mcstruct 或从世界中提取区域。`,"Create a blank blueprint, open a Bedrock `.mcstructure` or Structure Studio `.craftbox` project, or extract a region from captured or local terrain. From world accepts inclusive block coordinates, and local inputs can provide a dimension choice.":"创建空白蓝图,打开基岩 `.mcstructure` 或 Structure Studio `.craftbox` 项目,或从捕获的或本地地形中提取区域。 From world 接受包含块坐标,本地输入可以提供维度选择。","Create render":`创建渲染`,"Creation studio":`创作工作室`,Credits:`积分`,"Crop, dimension, and spawn validation":`裁剪、尺寸和生成验证`,"Ctrl+R":`Ctrl+R`,"Current render supports folders, .mcworld archives, and dimension selection.":`当前渲染支持文件夹、.mcworld 档案和尺寸选择。`,"Current source compatibility":`电流源兼容性`,"Current source handles NetherNet connections. Exact game compatibility follows its binary and protocol dependencies.":`电流源处理NetherNet 连接。确切的游戏兼容性遵循其二进制和协议依赖性。`,"Current upstream replays files headlessly by default. The replay-join option waits for Minecraft.":`当前上游默认无头重播文件。重播加入选项等待Minecraft。`,"Current upstream shades terrain by height and blends biome colors and water depth.":`当前上游根据高度对地形进行着色,并混合生物群落颜色和水深。`,"Custom entity capture setting":`自定义实体捕获设置`,"Custom geometry and cosmetics depend on the data present in the source appearance.":`自定义几何体和外观取决于源外观中存在的数据。`,"Custom servers, Realms, friend sessions, Featured Servers, and Experiences can differ in authentication, reachability, or the worlds they make available. Test the specific source through the supported desktop flow.":`自定义服务器、领域、好友会话、特色服务器和体验在身份验证、可访问性或它们提供的世界方面可能有所不同。通过支持的桌面流程测试特定源。`,Data:`数据`,"Daylight and HDR environments":`日光和 HDR 环境`,"Decide before connecting what evidence your project needs. Terrain, dynamic entities, player appearances, resource pack material, and scoreboards are separate outputs. Test a short visit before a longer capture to check the chosen options on the installed version.":`在连接您的项目需要什么证据之前决定。地形、动态实体、玩家外观、资源包材料和记分板是单独的输出。在进行较长时间的捕获之前测试短暂的访问,以检查已安装版本上所选的选项。`,"Decide what a .craftbox project keeps and check that a document can be reopened or moved.":`决定 .craftbox 项目保留哪些内容并检查文档是否可以重新打开或移动。`,"Decide what the result needs to contain before starting. World visits keep terrain and selected data together. Extra models, entities, and packet recordings can increase output size.":`在开始之前决定结果需要包含什么。世界访问将地形和选定的数据放在一起。额外的模型、实体和数据包记录可以增加输出大小。`,"Decide what to do on first launch":`决定首次启动时要做什么`,"Decide whether backup only is enough":`决定仅备份是否足够`,"Decoding and schemas":`解码和模式`,"Decoding and validation coverage depend on the selected source and schema.":`解码和验证覆盖范围取决于所选的源和模式。`,"Default inspection and export views redact recognized sensitive data. A raw archive can retain original session material. Use a verified redacted excerpt and remove unrelated or private content before sharing.":`默认检查和导出视图会编辑已识别的敏感数据。原始存档可以保留原始会话材料。使用经过验证的编辑摘录,并在共享之前删除不相关或私人内容。`,"Default retention is 100 MiB, 14 days, and 20 sessions. Storage and log detail can be changed in Preferences. If a report requires a particular interval, isolate and review a short redacted excerpt before the oldest closed sessions rotate out.":`默认保留时间为 100 MiB、14 天和 20 个会话。存储和日志详细信息可以在首选项中更改。如果报告需要特定的时间间隔,请在最旧的封闭会话轮流结束之前隔离并查看简短的编辑摘录。`,"Deliver a cinematic":`交付电影`,"Dependency preview and Find packs in Copy singleplayer world.":`复制单人游戏世界中的依赖预览和查找包。`,"Describe expected and observed behavior.":`描述预期和观察到的行为。`,Desktop:`桌面版`,"Desktop and CLI build targets":`桌面和 CLI 构建目标`,"Desktop graphical interface":`桌面图形界面`,"Desktop prerequisites in the CraftBox repository.":`CraftBox 存储库中的桌面先决条件。`,"Desktop quickstart":`桌面版快速入门`,"Desktop references":`桌面参考`,"Desktop setup and native workflows":`桌面设置和本机工作流程`,"Desktop sources retain recent visits and scoped capture settings.":`桌面源保留最近的访问和范围捕获设置。`,"Desktop workflow and command line":`桌面工作流程和命令行`,"Desktop workspaces expose configurable bindings and command search.":`桌面工作区公开可配置的绑定和命令搜索。`,"Desktop world composition":`桌面世界构成`,"Desktop world copy operations":`桌面世界复制操作`,"Device sign-in and saved account selection through CLI or GUI.":`通过CLI 或 GUI 登录设备并保存帐户选择。`,"Device sign-in, account switching, and a profile-aware desktop account view.":`设备登录、帐户切换和配置文件感知桌面帐户视图。`,"Diagnose a model with missing materials":`诊断缺少材料的模型`,"Diagnose missing terrain or visuals":`诊断缺失的地形或视觉效果`,"Differentiate missing, extra, changed, misoriented, and unknown cells.":`区分缺失、多余、改变、定向错误和未知细胞。`,"Dimension, spawn, and region validation":`尺寸、生成和区域验证`,"Discover supported installations or select a world folder directly.":`发现支持的安装或直接选择世界文件夹。`,"Discover supported sources and view available player counts.":`发现支持的来源并查看可用的玩家数量。`,"Discovery helps pick a connection. The Marketplace workspace reads online catalog offers associated with supported Discovery sources.":`发现帮助选择连接。 Marketplace 工作区读取与支持的 Discovery 源关联的在线目录商品。`,"Distance and area":`距离和面积`,Docs:`文档`,Documentation:`文档`,Download:`下载`,"Download {0}":`下载 {0}`,"Download channel":`发布渠道`,"Download CraftBox":`下载 CraftBox`,"Download for {0}":`下载 {0} 版`,"Download the ZIP for Apple Silicon or Intel and extract CraftBox.app. Releases use ad-hoc signing. See Apple’s guidance on opening apps from outside the App Store if macOS blocks the first launch.":`下载 Apple Silicon 或 Intel 的 ZIP 并解压 CraftBox.app。发布使用临时签名。如果 macOS 阻止首次启动,请参阅 Apple 关于从 App Store 外部打开应用程序的指南。`,"Downloads and packages resource packs. Matching every validation and recovery branch was outside this review.":`下载并打包资源包。匹配每个验证和恢复分支不在本次审查范围内。`,"Drag a selection or enter its bounds numerically. The selection reports captured and missing chunks. Resize the region when you need to exclude gaps or retain only a structure for editing.":`拖动选区或以数字方式输入其边界。选择报告捕获和丢失的块。当您需要排除间隙或仅保留结构进行编辑时,请调整区域大小。`,"dump-actors supports JSON export and writing actor data back to an eligible world.":`dump-actors 支持 JSON 将 actor 数据导出并写回符合条件的世界。`,"e.g. map art, GLB, or Android":`例如地图艺术,GLB,或 Android`,"Each blueprint opens in its own document tab.":`每个蓝图都会在其自己的文档选项卡中打开。`,"Each tab owns its dirty state and save location. Use Save As to create a deliberate fork, then reopen the new file to confirm that its view and content match your intent.":`每个选项卡都拥有其脏状态和保存位置。使用“另存为”创建有意的分支,然后重新打开新文件以确认其视图和内容符合您的意图。`,"Edit a blueprint in Structure Studio":`在Structure Studio编辑蓝图`,"Edit Bedrock blueprints by layer, count materials, compare revisions, and place the result into a world copy.":`按层编辑基岩蓝图、计算材料、比较修订版本并将结果放入世界副本中。`,"Edit pixels and save the result as a distinct item.":`编辑像素并将结果保存为不同的项目。`,"Edit the skin texture and save the result as a separate local library item.":`编辑皮肤纹理并将结果保存为单独的本地库项目。`,"Editable asset exports":`可编辑资源导出`,"Editable Blockbench export":`可编辑 Blockbench 导出`,"Editable Blockbench projects":`可编辑 Blockbench 项目`,"Editable projects can include embedded PNGs and supported animation channels with pre/post keyframes.":`可编辑项目可以包含嵌入的 PNG 和支持的带有前/后关键帧的动画通道。`,"Editable source animation data":`可编辑源动画数据`,Editor:`编辑器`,"Editor action":`编辑器动作`,"Editor document tabs":`编辑器文档选项卡`,"Editor overview of the candle test scene":`蜡烛测试场景编辑器概览`,"Editor playback and the original Minecraft runtime support different material and animation behavior.":`编辑器播放和原始Minecraft运行时支持不同的材质和动画行为。`,"Editor preview":`编辑器预览`,"Elevation and relief":`高程和地势`,"Encoder availability depends on the desktop web runtime. When a format is unavailable, choose one the export dialog can encode on your system.":`编码器可用性取决于桌面 Web 运行时。当格式不可用时,请选择导出对话框可以在您的系统上编码的一种格式。`,"End the visit, open the result folder, and check the world and enabled exports.":`结束访问,打开结果文件夹,查看世界和启用的导出。`,Enter:`输入`,"Enter `/cli` in a CraftBox console tab to open its interactive CLI. This command set works with the running desktop’s worlds, assets, and logs. Use `help` there to list its commands.":"在CraftBox控制台选项卡中输入`/cli`以打开其交互式CLI。该命令集适用于正在运行的桌面的世界、资产和日志。使用 `help` 列出其命令。","Enter free-camera mode if you need to reposition, then capture the view as a new keyframe.":`如果需要重新定位,请进入自由相机模式,然后将视图捕获为新的关键帧。`,"Entities and custom entities":`实体和自定义实体`,"Entities and inventories":`实体和库存`,"Entities and skins":`实体和皮肤`,"Entity and inventory recording default on in the reviewed world command.":`实体和库存记录在已审查的世界命令中默认开启。`,"Equivalent guarantees across each upstream command were not verified.":`未验证每个上游命令的等效保证。`,"Equivalent redaction behavior across its logging and recording workflows was not established.":`未建立跨日志记录和记录工作流程的等效编辑行为。`,Esc:`退出`,Escape:`逃脱`,"Establish the scene":`建立场景`,"Executable naming and build targets":`可执行文件命名和构建目标`,"Explore CraftBox workspaces for Bedrock capture, maps, blueprints, renders, assets, and diagnostics.":`探索用于基岩捕获、地图、蓝图、渲染、资产和诊断的CraftBox工作区。`,"Explore the Blockbench export feature":`探索Blockbench导出功能`,"Explore the CraftBox desktop workflow and compare a recorded editor view with its exported output.":`探索 CraftBox 桌面工作流程并将录制的编辑器视图与其导出的输出进行比较。`,"Explore the desktop and command-line tools for working with Minecraft Bedrock worlds.":`探索用于处理 Minecraft Bedrock 世界的桌面和命令行工具。`,"Explore the desktop walkthrough":`探索桌面演练`,"Explore the desktop workflow in repository screenshots, then compare an editor view with its exported output.":`在存储库屏幕截图中探索桌面工作流程,然后将编辑器视图与其导出的输出进行比较。`,"Explore the desktop workflow using repository screenshots":`使用存储库屏幕截图探索桌面工作流程`,"Explore the Offers or Collections view. Search and filter by parameters supported by the source. A filter can leave a fetched page empty even when later pages contain results. Treat loaded counts as a view of the current results.":`探索优惠或收藏视图。按源支持的参数进行搜索和过滤。即使后面的页面包含结果,过滤器也可以将获取的页面保留为空。将加载计数视为当前结果的视图。`,"Explore the render demo":`探索渲染演示`,"Explore the workspace":`探索工作空间`,Export:`导出

当外部查看器或 3D 应用程序需要同时显示几何体和材质时,`,"Export `.mcworld` copies the Bedrock database, available pack files, inventories, metadata, and activation settings in their original order. The task view shows progress and allows cancellation.":"导出`.mcworld`按原始顺序复制基岩数据库、可用包文件、库存、元数据和激活设置。任务视图显示进度并允许取消。","Export a cinematic":`导出动画`,"Export a mixed audio track":`导出混合音轨`,"Export a sample frame or a short timeline range before committing to the full sequence.":`在提交完整序列之前导出示例帧或短时间线范围。`,"Export a second version from a completed visit":`从已完成的访问中导出第二个版本`,"Export a static textured model":`导出静态纹理模型`,"Export a still for a single frame, a panorama for a spherical image, or a cinematic for a timed sequence. Image dimensions, crop, transparency, and encoder settings belong to the output you choose.":`导出单帧静态图像、球形图像的全景图或定时序列的电影。图像尺寸、裁剪、透明度和编码器设置属于您选择的输出。`,"Export a still, panorama, or map":`导出静态照片、全景图或地图`,"Export a textured GLB":`导出纹理GLB`,"Export again and verify the resource and behavior pack order on the receiving device.":`再次导出并验证接收设备上的资源和行为包顺序。`,"Export an editable .bbmodel with embedded textures, or choose a static output such as GLB.":`导出带有嵌入纹理的可编辑.bb模型,或选择静态输出,例如GLB。`,"Export an editable Blockbench project":`导出可编辑的Blockbench项目`,"Export assets to Blockbench":`将资产导出到Blockbench`,"Export captured item-frame maps as PNG tiles and assembled walls.":`将捕获的物品框架地图导出为 PNG 瓷砖和组装墙。`,"Export detail follows available terrain. The composition workflow supports up to 16 source regions.":`导出详细信息遵循可用地形。合成工作流程最多支持 16 个源区域。`,"Export GLB when an external viewer or 3D application needs the displayed geometry and materials together. Static exports preserve the displayed model or pose, while an editable `.bbmodel` uses source geometry and supported source animation data.":"导出 GLB。静态导出保留显示的模型或姿势,而可编辑的 `.bbmodel` 使用源几何体和支持的源动画数据。","Export GLB, glTF, OBJ, FBX, or geometry-only STL from retained source geometry.":`从保留的源几何图形中导出 GLB、glTF、OBJ、FBX 或仅几何图形的 STL。

在工作流程支持的情况下导出`,"Export image":`导出图像`,"Export PNG, JPEG, WebP, TIFF, and BMP where supported by the workflow.":`导出 PNG、JPEG、WebP、TIFF 和 BMP。`,"Export preview and spawn validation":`导出预览和生成验证`,"Export progress and cancellation":`导出进度与取消`,"Export received forms, recorded navigation, and scoreboard data as part of the world.":`将收到的表格、记录的导航和记分板数据导出为世界的一部分。`,"Export safeguards and shared limits":`出口保障和共同限制`,"Export stills and panoramas in formats including PNG, JPEG, WebP, TIFF, and BMP.":`以PNG、JPEG、WebP、TIFF 和 BMP 等格式导出静态照片和全景图。`,"Export supported metadata for local comparison. Review it before sharing and verify availability against the source again if the offer changes.":`导出支持的元数据以进行本地比较。在共享之前进行审查,并在优惠发生变化时再次根据来源验证可用性。`,"Export supported source objects as editable .bbmodel projects with embedded textures.":`将支持的源对象导出为具有嵌入纹理的可编辑 .bbmodel 项目。`,"Export the displayed shape as a static 3D model independently of source-project export.":`将显示的形状导出为静态 3D 模型,独立于源项目导出。`,"Export the map":`导出地图`,"Export the timeline as a video or GIF when the selected runtime can encode it.":`当所选运行时可以对其进行编码时,将时间线导出为视频或 GIF。`,"Exported close-up":`导出特写`,"Exported close-up of candles in the CraftBox test scene":`导出CraftBox测试场景中的蜡烛特写`,"Extract a structure, edit its blocks, and compare it with a previous version. Keep the material list or place the finished blueprint into a world copy.":`提取结构,编辑其块,并将其与以前的版本进行比较。保留材料清单或将完成的蓝图放入世界副本中。`,"Extract model parts and choose Bedrock Entity, Bedrock Block, or Generic Model.":`提取模型零件并选择基岩实体、基岩块或通用模型。`,"Extract selection to new document preserves gaps between disjoint boxes as Structure Void. This allows the gaps to remain untouched when the result is pasted.":`将选择提取到新文档会将不相交框之间的间隙保留为结构空洞。这使得粘贴结果时间隙保持不变。`,"Favorites save environment, source, and item identifiers. Reopen one online to resolve its current details. If the offer is no longer available, the stored reference can still be removed.":`收藏夹保存环境、来源和项目标识符。在线重新打开一个以解决其当前详细信息。如果优惠不再可用,仍然可以删除存储的参考。`,"FBX ZIP":`FBX 邮政编码`,Feature:`特点`,"Feature categories":`功能类别`,"Featured server discovery":`特色服务器发现`,Features:`功能`,file:`文件`,File:`文件`,"File checksum":`文件校验和`,"File formats":`文件格式`,files:`文件`,"Files to keep together":`要保存在一起的文件`,"Fill, replace, copy, cut, or paste the selected blocks.":`填充、替换、复制、剪切或粘贴所选块。`,"Fill, replace, cut, paste, rotate, and mirror with supported orientation handling.":`使用支持的方向处理进行填充、替换、剪切、粘贴、旋转和镜像。`,"Filter recorded events and annotate relevant points in the timeline.":`过滤记录的事件并在时间轴中注释相关点。`,"Find a first workflow, a file format, or help with your setup.":`查找第一个工作流程、文件格式或设置帮助。`,"Find a function":`查找函数`,"Find a guide":`寻找指南`,"Find a local world and review exact pack dependencies before making a portable backup or a playable copy.":`在制作便携式备份或可播放副本之前,找到本地世界并检查确切的包依赖关系。`,"Find blocks, pick an existing state, or edit compatible custom properties.":`查找块、选择现有状态或编辑兼容的自定义属性。`,"Find files, inspect metadata, and export available content.":`查找文件、检查元数据并导出可用内容。`,"Find gaps before exporting a region.":`在导出区域之前查找间隙。`,"Find installed worlds and produce a separate .mcworld or backup copy.":`查找已安装的世界并生成单独的.mcworld 或备份副本。`,"Find published Windows, Linux, and macOS desktop and CLI builds on GitHub.":`查找已发布的 Windows、Linux 和 macOS 桌面,CLI 构建于 GitHub 之上。`,"Find quickstarts, workflows, compatibility guidance, and file formats for CraftBox.":`查找 CraftBox 的快速入门、工作流程、兼容性指南和文件格式。`,"Find the asset in the library":`在库中查找资源`,"Find the main or map session by time and window role.":`按时间和窗口角色查找主会话或地图会话。`,"Find the part worth keeping":`找到值得保留的部分`,"Find the right CraftBox guide or feature.":`查找适合你的 CraftBox 指南或功能。`,"Find the right local log session and prepare a useful report with only the evidence it needs.":`找到对应的本地日志会话，只保留必要的信息来撰写问题报告。`,"Find the tag or version reported by your installed CraftBox build and check that release’s notes. The reviewed source revision declares Minecraft 1.26.65 and Bedrock protocol 2225. Use the published release notes when you need to establish the target of a specific binary.":`Find the tag or version reported by your installed CraftBox build and check that release’s notes.已审查的源版本声明 Minecraft 1.26.65 和 Bedrock 协议 2225。当您需要建立特定二进制文件的目标时,请使用已发布的发行说明。`,"Find the world":`寻找世界`,"Find your output again":`再次找到你的输出`,"Finish the visit":`结束参观`,"Finish unrelated work safely before expecting final status. Active sessions are protected from cleanup.":`Finish unrelated work safely before expecting final status.活动会话受到保护,免遭清理。`,"First decide whether the game cannot reach CraftBox’s local endpoint or CraftBox cannot reach the upstream source. They require different checks.":`First decide whether the game cannot reach CraftBox’s local endpoint or CraftBox cannot reach the upstream source.他们需要不同的检查。`,"First-run decisions and installation identity":`首次运行决策和安装标识`,"Focus and world scale":`焦点和世界规模`,"Fog and cloud volumes":`雾和云量`,"Follow the live Atlas, mark landmarks, and use coverage to check the terrain you received. Save a region for a new world or export an annotated map.":`Follow the live Atlas, mark landmarks, and use coverage to check the terrain you received.保存新世界的区域或导出带注释的地图。`,"Follow the player on a tiled map, mark points of interest, and merge selected terrain into a separate world.":`在分块地图上跟随玩家、标记有趣的地点，并将选中的地形合并到单独的世界中。`,"Font Awesome Free":`字体真棒免费`,"Footer navigation":`页脚导航`,"For a disjoint selection, the spaces between selected boxes become Structure Void when extracted to a new document.":`如果选区由互不相连的区域组成，提取到新文档时，区域之间的空隙会填入结构空位方块。`,"For a finished still, use the image export in Render editor. Keep both the project and the image if you expect to revise the shot.":`对于完成的静止图像,请使用渲染编辑器中的图像导出。 Keep both the project and the image if you expect to revise the shot.`,"For a live visit, revisit any needed missing location. For a finished visit, reduce the selection or document the gaps.":`对于现场访问,重新访问任何需要的缺失位置。对于完成的访问,减少选择或记录差距。`,"For code and documentation contributions, follow the":`对于代码和文档贡献,请遵循`,Format:`格式`,"Frame a captured or imported Bedrock world, design its lighting, and render a still or panorama.":`构建捕获或导入的基岩世界,设计其照明,并渲染静态或全景图。`,"Frame an identifiable landmark. Pick a look, then adjust exposure or time of day before changing several controls together.":`框出可识别的地标。选择一个外观,然后调整曝光或一天中的时间,然后一起更改多个控件。`,"Frame and crop a scene":`构图并裁剪场景`,"Frame the world you explored":`框出你探索过的世界`,"Free and open source":`免费开源`,"Free-camera controls are scoped to the focused viewport. Escape returns to orbit, and playback or export disables free navigation.":`自由相机控件的范围仅限于聚焦视口。逃逸返回轨道,播放或导出将禁用自由导航。`,Function:`功能`,"Function-by-function comparison, shared capabilities, export tools, and source revisions":`逐个功能比较、共享功能、导出工具和源代码修订`,"Generate camera and appearance suggestions from the loaded terrain.":`从加载的地形生成相机和外观建议。`,Generator:`发电机`,"Generic Model":`通用型号`,"Geometry and materials packaged together":`几何形状和材料封装在一起`,"Geometry, UVs, normals, texture opacity, and approximate material properties. Check the result in the destination application.":`几何、UV、法线、纹理不透明度和近似材质属性。在目标应用程序中检查结果。`,"Get CraftBox Desktop or the command-line build for Windows, Linux, or macOS.":`获取CraftBox Desktop 或适用于 Windows、Linux 或 macOS 的命令行版本。`,"Get started":`开始使用`,"Getting started":`入门`,"GIF carries frames only. Use a video container with supported audio to preserve sound.":`GIF 仅携带帧。使用支持音频的视频容器来保留声音。`,"Gio displays progress for world saves. No equivalent media-export task workspace was found.":`Gio 显示世界保存进度。未找到等效的媒体导出任务工作区。`,"Gio provides capture mode selection and CLI equivalents.":`Gio 提供捕获模式选择和 CLI 等效项。`,GitHub:`GitHub`,"GitHub returned {0}.":`GitHub 返回{0}。`,"GitHub returned no published releases.":`GitHub 返回未发布的版本。`,GLB:`GLB`,"GLB or glTF":`GLB 或 glTF`,"GLB or static export":`GLB 或静态导出`,"GLB packages geometry and available textures in one file. CraftBox can also export glTF, OBJ, FBX, and STL. For multi-file results, extract the archive and keep its related files together.":`GLB 将几何体和可用纹理打包在一个文件中。 CraftBox还可以导出glTF、OBJ、FBX和STL。对于多文件结果,请提取存档并将其相关文件放在一起。`,"GLB renderer options":`GLB 渲染器选项`,"Global texture packs are optional.":`全局材质包是可选的。`,"glTF ZIP":`glTF 邮编`,"GNU GPL v3.0":`GNU GPL v3.0`,"Go to the home page":`进入首页`,"GPL-3.0 license":`GPL-3.0 许可证`,"Grading and depth of field":`分级和景深`,"Group saved appearances and inspect supported arm models, poses, capes, and clothing layers.":`对保存的外观进行分组并检查支持的手臂模型、姿势、斗篷和服装层。`,Guide:`指南`,"Guide index":`指导索引`,"Guide section":`引导部分`,Guides:`指南`,"Handle Realm Stories as part of the connection flow.":`将领域故事作为连接流的一部分进行处理。

渲染编辑器中的`,"Hive Games scene in Render editor":`Hive Games 场景`,Home:`首页`,"How to read this comparison":`如何阅读此比较`,"icons by Fonticons, Inc. under":`图标由 Fonticons, Inc. 提供`,"Identify steep areas or compare heights.":`识别陡峭区域或比较高度。`,"Identify which stage failed, recover without losing work, and prepare a clear issue report.":`确定哪个阶段失败了,在不丢失工作的情况下恢复,并准备一份清晰的问题报告。`,"If a custom appearance disappeared, inspect the copied resource and behavior pack dependencies before changing render settings.":`如果自定义外观消失,请在更改渲染设置之前检查复制的资源和行为包依赖项。`,"If a player or spawn location was excluded, select an explicit replacement spawn in a retained dimension.":`如果排除了玩家或生成位置,请在保留维度中选择显式替换生成。`,"If a save fails or is cancelled, the document remains open. Resolve the cause before closing or choosing discard.":`如果保存失败或被取消,文档仍保持打开状态。在关闭或选择丢弃之前解决原因。`,"If a structure contains unknown cells, inspect the selected region before exporting or placing it. Unknown capture coverage is different from known air.":`如果结构包含未知单元,请在导出或放置之前检查所选区域。未知捕获范围与已知空气不同。`,"If the intended pack was never supplied, check the capture settings and retry with a source that makes the necessary data available.":`如果从未提供预期的包,请检查捕获设置并使用可提供必要数据的源重试。`,"If the old spawn was excluded, explicitly choose a replacement location in a retained dimension.":`如果旧的生成点被排除,请在保留维度中显式选择替换位置。`,"Ignore source air":`忽略气源`,Image:`图片`,"Image formats":`图像格式`,"Image, model & video export":`图片、模型和视频导出`,Implemented:`已实施`,"Implemented in both":`在两者中均实现`,"Import a Bedrock world":`导入基岩世界`,"Import an available snapshot pack into the asset library.":`将可用的快照包导入到资源库中。`,"Import diagnostic formats":`导入诊断格式`,"Import local assets":`导入本地资源`,"Import local packs or organize pack assets available from a capture using tags and favorites.":`导入本地包或使用标签和收藏夹组织捕获中可用的包资源。`,"Import or export a blueprint":`导入或导出蓝图`,"Import supported packs or skins for inspection alongside captured assets.":`导入受支持的包或皮肤,以便与捕获的资产一起进行检查。`,"In Cinematic editor, use the Camera and Sequence controls to choose the view and timing. Light, Atmosphere, and Color edit the shared scene appearance. This lets you preserve a consistent look while you revise the path or change a single shot.":`在电影编辑器中,使用摄像机和序列控件选择视图和时间。灯光、气氛和颜色编辑共享场景外观。这使您可以在修改路径或更改单个镜头时保持一致的外观。`,"In Downloads, select Stable for a regular installation or Preview to evaluate recent changes. Choose Desktop and match both the operating system and architecture to the published file.":`在“下载”中,选择“稳定”进行常规安装,或选择“预览”以评估最近的更改。选择桌面并将操作系统和体系结构与已发布的文件相匹配。`,"In Preferences, open Diagnostics & logs to see the actual storage location. Main and separate map windows have independent logs. Use the session’s version, start time, and status to pick the relevant one.":`在“首选项”中,打开“诊断和日志”以查看实际存储位置。主地图窗口和单独的地图窗口具有独立的日志。使用会话的版本、开始时间和状态来选择相关的版本。`,"In the interactive desktop CLI, show a short slice of recent errors. Change the count or severity when a different time window gives better context. Check the output before copying it into an issue.":`在交互式桌面CLI中,显示最近错误的一小部分。当不同的时间窗口提供更好的上下文时,更改计数或严重性。在将输出复制到问题中之前检查输出。`,"In-game building hologram":`游戏内建筑全息图`,"In-game capture menu":`游戏内捕捉菜单`,"Include the evidence alongside the workflow, build version, reproduction steps, and whether the result persists with a smaller input. Review the final issue body and attachments for information that should stay local.":`包括工作流程、构建版本、复制步骤以及结果是否能在较小的输入下持续存在的证据。查看最终问题正文和附件,以获取应保留在本地的信息。`,"Include your operating system, CraftBox release, Bedrock build, selected workflow, steps, expected outcome, and exact error text. Attach a safe screenshot or redacted log excerpt only when it provides evidence. Review any shared material carefully.":`包括您的操作系统、CraftBox 版本、基岩版本、选定的工作流程、步骤、预期结果和确切的错误文本。仅在提供证据时才附上安全屏幕截图或经过编辑的日志摘录。仔细审查任何共享材料。`,"Includes air from the blueprint when replacing the destination.":`更换目的地时包括蓝图中的空气。`,"Independent editor documents":`独立编辑文档`,"Independent map window":`独立地图窗口`,"Ingame commands":`游戏内命令`,Input:`输入`,"input, textarea, select, [contenteditable]":`输入,文本区域,选择,[内容可编辑]`,"Inputs and outputs":`输入和输出`,"Insert a suggestion.":`插入建议。`,"Inspect a blueprint before export":`导出前检查蓝图`,"Inspect a captured or imported asset and choose an editable source export or a static model.":`检查捕获或导入的资源并选择可编辑的源导出或静态模型。`,"Inspect a captured or imported resource pack. Export supported models as editable .bbmodel or static geometry.":`检查捕获或导入的资源包。将支持的模型导出为可编辑的 .bbmodel 或静态几何体。`,"Inspect a saved session":`检查保存的会话`,"Inspect advertised server commands, their overloads, and parameters.":`检查通告的服务器命令、它们的重载和参数。`,"Inspect an item":`检查物品`,"Inspect an observation":`检查观察结果`,"Inspect available imagery, descriptions, prices, and supported preview data.":`检查可用的图像、描述、价格和支持的预览数据。`,"Inspect binary data and strings, or open supported image and sound previews.":`检查二进制数据和字符串,或打开支持的图像和声音预览。`,"Inspect coverage and select a region":`检查覆盖范围并选择区域`,"Inspect exact pack dependencies, make a portable Bedrock archive, and preserve the source.":`检查确切的包依赖关系,制作可移植的基岩存档,并保留源代码。`,"Inspect file entries, model geometry, textures, and source bindings.":`检查文件条目、模型几何、纹理和源绑定。`,"Inspect height, biome, and coverage overlays. Jump to a coordinate or measure distance and area.":`检查高度、生物群落和覆盖范围。跳转到坐标或测量距离和面积。`,"Inspect its geometry":`检查其几何形状`,"Inspect local session status, logs, and retention settings in the desktop app.":`检查桌面应用程序中的本地会话状态、日志和保留设置。`,"Inspect native recordings and supported ProxyPass or ProxyWeb exports. Text-only input has less retained detail.":`检查本机录音和支持的 ProxyPass 或 ProxyWeb 导出。纯文本输入保留的细节较少。`,"Inspect one Y level at a time with optional adjacent context and a 2D grid.":`使用可选的相邻上下文和 2D 网格一次检查一个 Y 层。`,"Inspect raw chunks, block heights, biome names, and recorded coverage before building meshes.":`在构建网格之前检查原始块、块高度、生物群落名称和记录的覆盖范围。`,"Inspect saved appearances in 3D, including supported captured geometry, clothing layers, and cosmetics.":`检查保存的 3D 外观,包括支持的捕获的几何体、服装层和化妆品。`,"Inspect sounds from a resource pack with waveforms and a multitrack listening preview.":`使用波形和多轨聆听预览检查资源包中的声音。`,"Inspect supported encoded inputs, compare structured fields, and validate against available schemas.":`检查支持的编码输入、比较结构化字段并根据可用模式进行验证。`,"Inspect supported geometry, UVs, materials, poses, and available animations.":`检查支持的几何体、UV、材质、姿势和可用动画。`,"Inspect the appearance":`检查外观`,"Inspect the block identity, state, and direction before replacing it.":`在替换之前检查块的身份、状态和方向。`,"Inspect the captured assets":`检查捕获的资产`,"Inspect the dependency preview before starting the export.":`在开始导出之前检查依赖项预览。`,"Inspect the destination’s local library before sharing a workspace file. It is a document of your view and references.":`在共享工作区文件之前检查目标的本地库。它是您的观点和参考的文档。`,"Inspect the object’s binding and source before choosing a model with a similar name. A supplied block or entity definition can point to different geometry and textures for different states. Explicit bindings take priority over inferred matches.":`在选择具有相似名称的模型之前检查对象的绑定和源。提供的块或实体定义可以指向不同状态的不同几何体和纹理。显式绑定优先于推断的匹配。`,"Inspect the pack’s original geometry and material bindings. Export supported bones, cubes, UVs, and textures as an editable Blockbench project.":`检查包装的原始几何形状和材料装订。将支持的骨骼、立方体、UV 和纹理导出为可编辑的 Blockbench 项目。`,"Inspect the source model":`检查源模型`,"Inspect which material a block face uses and preview supported alternate packs.":`检查块面使用的材质并预览支持的替代包。`,"Inspect your build’s commands, render a local world, and use the desktop console for local tasks.":`检查构建的命令,渲染本地世界,并使用桌面控制台执行本地任务。`,"Inspection & automation":`检测与自动化`,"Install CraftBox and open a world.":`安装CraftBox并打开一个世界。`,"Installation snapshots":`安装快照`,"Integrated console":`集成控制台`,Intel:`Intel`,"Interactive desktop CLI":`互动桌面CLI`,"Interface controls exist. A comprehensive shortcut-parity review was outside this source check.":`存在界面控件。全面的快捷方式平价审查不在此源检查之外。`,"Interface translations":`界面翻译`,"Interpret results that change between requests":`解释请求之间变化的结果`,"Interpret timing and gaps":`解释时间和间隙`,"Interpreting the preview":`解读预览`,Interrupted:`中断`,Inventories:`库存`,"Investigate an authorized recording offline.":`离线调查授权录音。`,"Isolate the base":`隔离底座`,Item:`项目`,"Item availability and preview quality depend on the published source data.":`商品可用性和预览质量取决于已发布的源数据。`,"Item-frame and container map art":`物品框架和容器地图艺术`,"JavaScript capture hooks":`JavaScript 捕获钩子`,"Join an authorized Bedrock source through CraftBox and save the terrain your client receives as you explore.":`通过 CraftBox 加入授权的基岩源,并保存您的客户在探索时收到的地形。`,"Join and explore":`加入探索`,"JPEG and BMP are opaque in the reviewed export workflow. Choose a matte color when required.":`JPEG 和 BMP 在审核的导出工作流程中是不透明的。需要时选择哑光颜色。`,"Keep a native map window open independently of the main workspace.":`保持原生地图窗口独立于主工作区打开。`,"Keep advanced outputs separate":`将高级输出分开`,"Keep an editable master":`保留可编辑的母版`,"Keep any already existing good output until the new copy has opened successfully.":`保留任何现有的良好输出,直到新副本成功打开。`,"Keep camera moves responsive while composing. Raise quality and check a frame before export.":`构图时保持相机移动灵敏。提高质量并在导出前检查框架。`,"Keep catalog queries and favorites separated by environment.":`将目录查询和收藏夹按环境分开。`,"Keep enough terrain for the next pass":`为下一次穿越保留足够的地形`,"Keep identifier-only favorites and export supported metadata.":`保留仅标识符收藏夹并导出支持的元数据。`,"Keep identifiers and resolve them against the selected online catalog.":`保留标识符并根据所选在线目录解析它们。`,"Keep independent documents in tabs with their own saved state.":`将独立文档保留在具有自己保存状态的选项卡中。`,"Keep local edits reversible in the active structure document.":`在活动结构文档中保持本地编辑可逆。`,"Keep saved appearance variants together and switch between supported arm models.":`将保存的外观变体保留在一起,并在支持的手臂模型之间切换。`,"Keep supported hierarchy, texture assignments, and source animations or controllers where present.":`保留支持的层次结构、纹理分配以及源动画或控制器(如果存在)。`,"Keep the camera, timing, and scene look separate":`保持相机、时间和场景看起来独立`,"Keep the larger original world or source project alongside a cropped copy.":`将较大的原始世界或源项目与裁剪后的副本一起保留。`,"Keep the recording private":`保持录音私密`,"Keep the relevant evidence before retention runs":`在保留运行之前保留相关证据`,"Keep the world’s ownership requirements in mind. Access on another device can require the account entitlement.":`牢记世界的所有权要求。在其他设备上访问可能需要帐户权限。`,Key:`钥匙`,"Keyframe position, target, field of view, focus, and other supported channels.":`关键帧位置、目标、视野、焦点和其他支持的通道。`,"Keyframes can independently control position, target, field of view, roll, exposure, focus distance, and aperture. Work on the channels that change during the shot.":`关键帧可以独立控制位置、目标、视野、滚动、曝光、焦距和光圈。处理拍摄过程中发生变化的通道。`,"Know what your editor stores":`了解您的编辑器存储的内容`,Language:`语言`,latest:`最新`,"Latest in channel":`渠道中的最新版本`,"Launch CraftBox Desktop and open Render editor.":`启动CraftBox桌面并打开渲染编辑器。`,"Layer isolation":`层间隔离`,Layers:`层数`,"Learn and contribute":`学习并贡献`,"Learn CraftBox":`学习CraftBox`,"Learn how to keep a smaller region":`了解如何保留较小的区域`,"Learn who maintains CraftBox, where the project comes from, and how to get involved.":`了解谁维护CraftBox、项目来自哪里以及如何参与。`,"Leaves destination blocks in positions where the source contains air.":`将目标块留在源包含空气的位置。`,"Legacy RakNet is unavailable in the reviewed branch. A visible server address alone does not establish compatibility.":`旧版 RakNet 在审核分支中不可用。单独可见的服务器地址并不能建立兼容性。`,"Library source ID, camera, model or variant, selected view settings, and supported drafts.":`库源 ID、相机、模型或变体、选定的视图设置以及支持的草稿。`,"Library workspace file save behavior":`库工作区文件保存行为`,"Library, bindings, and model previews":`库、绑定和模型预览`,License:`许可证`,"Lighting controls":`灯光控制`,"Limited detail":`有限细节`,Link:`链接`,"Link an account that can access that server, Realm, Experience, or friend when the source requires it.":`链接一个可以在源需要时访问该服务器、领域、体验或好友的帐户。`,"Link to this entry":`链接到此条目`,Linux:`Linux`,"Linux Desktop":`Linux 桌面`,"Linux desktop libraries":`Linux 桌面库`,"List available commands and check the help for the installed build.":`列出可用命令并检查已安装版本的帮助。`,"Listen to supported assets, view waveforms, and inspect playhead position.":`聆听支持的资源、查看波形并检查播放头位置。`,"Live Atlas & region tools":`实时地图集和区域工具`,"Live capture map":`实时捕捉地图`,"Live following can pause independently of recording when you select or filter observations. For offline playback, the timeline steps through retained observations without contacting the original server.":`当您选择或过滤观察结果时,实时关注可以独立于录制而暂停。对于离线播放,时间线逐步浏览保留的观察结果,而无需联系原始服务器。`,"Load and frame the terrain":`加载并构建地形`,"Loading published releases…":`正在加载已发布的版本...`,"Local console reporting commands":`本地控制台报告命令`,"Local dependency and export implementation":`本地依赖和导出实现`,"Local diagnostics":`本地诊断`,"Local lights and block lighting":`局部灯和块照明`,"Local Packet Inspector operations":`本地Packet Inspector 操作`,"Local world copy":`本地世界副本`,"Local worlds can be read for render/merge; no corresponding installation-copy flow was found.":`可以读取本地世界进行渲染/合并;未找到相应的安装复制流程。`,"Locate the matching pack folder or resolve conflicting copies.":`找到匹配的包文件夹或解决冲突的副本。`,"Locked or missing dependencies can block a complete export. The original world is preserved.":`锁定或丢失的依赖项可能会阻止完整导出。原来的世界被保留下来。`,"Look for a retained native or Go fatal report and the nearby event records.":`查找保留的本机或 Go 致命报告以及附近的事件记录。`,"Look in the relevant workspace":`查看相关工作空间`,"macOS Desktop":`macOS 桌面`,"Main navigation":`主导航`,"Make a block-accurate selection":`进行块级精确选择`,"Make a first render you can revise":`制作第一个可以修改的渲染`,"Make repeated changes":`反复修改`,"Managed asset library":`托管资源库`,"Manual region tools":`手动区域工具`,"Map annotations":`地图标注`,"Map Art PNGs":`地图艺术 PNG`,"Map export, a new composed world, and a render project preserve different data. Create a distinct file for each recipient and keep the named region available while iterating.":`地图导出、新的组合世界和渲染项目保留不同的数据。为每个收件人创建一个不同的文件,并在迭代时保持指定区域可用。`,"Map exports have their own controls for annotations, pixel density, and region.":`地图导出有自己的注释、像素密度和区域控件。`,"Map overlays":`地图叠加`,"Map rendering uses custom biome color and depth-aware water shading.":`地图渲染使用自定义生物群落颜色和深度感知水着色。`,"Map window contract":`地图窗口合约`,"Map-art output uses `-map-art=true`, with `-map-art-out` for the destination. Use `-no-image=true` when you only need map art.":"地图艺术输出使用 `-map-art=true`,其中 `-map-art-out` 表示目的地。当您只需要地图艺术时,请使用`-no-image=true`。","Maps and regions":`地图和地区`,"Maps, world copies and composition":`地图、世界副本和合成`,Marketplace:`市场`,"Marketplace and offers":`市场和优惠`,"Marketplace and template settings are preserved with their original protection.":`市场和模板设置保留其原始保护。`,"Marketplace browsing is online. An offline desktop library item or favorite identifier does not provide a complete cached catalog.":`市场浏览已上线。脱机桌面库项目或收藏夹标识符不提供完整的缓存目录。`,"Marketplace interface":`市场界面`,"Match the connection transport":`匹配连接传输`,"Match the desktop platform":`匹配桌面平台`,"Match the requirement to the workflow":`将需求与工作流程相匹配`,Materials:`材料`,"Materials and estimated items":`材料和估算项目`,"Materials can count the entire blueprint, current selection, or active layer. Review block and estimated item counts, then print or export the list as CSV. Some paired blocks and slabs affect estimated item counts.":`材质可以计算整个蓝图、当前选择或活动图层。查看块和估计项目计数,然后打印列表或将列表导出为 CSV。一些配对的块和板会影响估计的物品数量。`,"Measure a known landmark after import to verify scale and origin. OBJ and FBX approximate some advanced material properties.":`进口后测量已知地标以验证规模和原产地。 OBJ 和 FBX 近似一些高级材料属性。`,"Measure an open path or a closed polygon on the Atlas.":`测量图集上的开放路径或闭合多边形。`,"Media inspection":`介质检查`,Menu:`菜单`,"Merged custom dimensions":`合并自定义尺寸`,"Merged-dimension capture now writes subsequent worlds as custom dimensions. Both implementations depend on compatible Bedrock and Script API support.":`合并维度捕获现在将后续世界写入自定义维度。两种实现都依赖于兼容的基岩和脚本API支持。`,"Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime, a writable application folder, and a published build for your CPU.":`Microsoft Edge WebView2 运行时、可写应用程序文件夹以及针对您的 CPU 的已发布版本。`,"Microsoft sign-in":`Microsoft 登录`,"Minecraft cannot connect":`Minecraft 无法连接`,"Minecraft data Archive":`Minecraft 数据存档`,"Missing or ambiguous":`缺失或不明确`,"Missing or extra":`缺失或多余`,"Mobile navigation":`手机导航`,Mode:`模式`,"Model export choices":`模型导出选择`,"Model picker and part extraction":`模型选择器和零件提取`,"Models & assets":`模型和资产`,"More in {0}":`更多内容见{0}`,"Move a scene or preview into a compatible 3D tool.":`将场景或预览移动到兼容的 3D 工具中。`,"Move a world into Minecraft or open it in CraftBox.":`将世界移至Minecraft或在CraftBox中打开它。`,"Move geometry to a 3D tool":`将几何体移动到 3D 工具`,"Move the playhead, update position or target, and add another keyframe.":`移动播放头,更新位置或目标,然后添加另一个关键帧。`,"Move through suggestions or command history.":`在建议或命令历史记录中移动。`,"Move through the areas you want to keep. The live map grows as the client receives terrain.":`穿过您想要保留的区域。实时地图随着客户端接收地形而增长。`,"MP4, WebM, and other video formats":`MP4、WebM等视频格式`,"Multitrack listening":`多轨聆听`,"Name a region":`命名一个区域`,"Named capture regions":`命名捕获区域`,"Native archive":`原生存档`,"Native diagnostics operations":`本机诊断操作`,"Native Marketplace behavior":`原生市场行为`,"Native recording files can be replayed. The other inspector input formats were not found.":`本机录音文件可回放。未找到其他检查器输入格式。`,"Native terminal tabs":`本机终端选项卡`,"Native world import and scene lifecycle":`原生世界导入和场景生命周期`,"Navigate and measure":`导航和测量`,"Navigate between supported saved observations and related pack, world, or skin entries.":`在支持的已保存观察结果和相关包、世界或皮肤条目之间导航。`,"Needs verification":`需要验证`,NetherNet:`NetherNet`,"New world":`新世界`,"Next step":`下一步`,"No 3D scene viewer was identified.":`未识别出 3D 场景查看器。`,"No building hologram was found in the reviewed source.":`在审查的来源中未找到建筑全息图。`,"No comparable catalog collection workflow was found.":`未找到类似的目录收集工作流程。`,"No comparable offer catalog workflow was found.":`未找到类似的报价目录工作流程。`,"No comparable offer favorites were found.":`未找到类似的优惠最爱。`,"No comparable offer previews were found.":`未找到类似的报价预览。`,"No corresponding audio mix exporter was found.":`未找到相应的音频混合导出器。`,"No corresponding catalog environments were found.":`未找到对应的目录环境。`,"No corresponding editor-document close flow was found.":`未找到对应的编辑器-文档关闭流程。`,"No corresponding local world-export planner was identified.":`没有确定相应的当地世界出口计划者。`,"No corresponding measurement tool was found.":`未找到对应的测量工具。`,"No corresponding multi-document studio was found.":`没有找到对应的多文档工作室。`,"No corresponding offer export was found.":`未找到对应的报价导出。`,"No equivalent Archive decoding workflow was found.":`未找到等效的存档解码工作流程。`,"No equivalent browser for advertised command metadata was found.":`找不到用于广告命令元数据的等效浏览器。`,"No equivalent found":`未找到等效项`,"No equivalent handoff from an installation snapshot was found.":`未找到来自安装快照的等效切换。`,"No equivalent inspector annotations were found.":`未找到等效的检查器注释。`,"No equivalent inspector links were found.":`未找到等效的检查器链接。`,"No equivalent installation snapshot workspace was found.":`未找到等效的安装快照工作区。`,"No equivalent interactive overlap review was identified.":`没有发现等效的交互式重叠审查。`,"No equivalent local dependency planner was found.":`未找到等效的本地依赖规划器。`,"No equivalent named-region editor and spawn workflow was found.":`未找到等效的命名区域编辑器和生成工作流程。`,"No equivalent recorded-field comparison was found.":`未找到等效的记录字段比较。`,"No equivalent saved annotations workspace was found.":`未找到等效的已保存注释工作区。`,"No equivalent set of Atlas overlays was found.":`未找到等效的 Atlas 覆盖集。`,"No equivalent snapshot browser was found.":`未找到等效的快照浏览器。`,"No equivalent snapshot media workflow was found.":`未找到等效的快照媒体工作流程。`,"No equivalent studio workflow was identified.":`未发现等效的工作室工作流程。`,"No equivalent traffic-analysis panel was found.":`未找到等效的流量分析面板。`,"No equivalent version-diff workflow was found.":`未找到等效的版本差异工作流程。`,"No functions match. Try a shorter term or clear a filter.":`没有功能匹配。尝试较短的期限或清除过滤器。`,"No guide matches your search.":`没有符合您搜索的指南。`,"No guides match. Try a shorter search or a file extension.":`没有匹配的指南。尝试更短的搜索或文件扩展名。`,"No Marketplace catalog workspace was found.":`未找到 Marketplace 目录工作区。`,"No matches in this category.":`此类别中没有匹配项。`,"No multitrack audio workspace was found.":`未找到多轨音频工作区。`,"No preview releases have been published.":`尚未发布预览版。`,"No published file matches these filters for this release.":`没有已发布的文件与此版本的这些过滤器匹配。`,"No published notes were found for version {0}.":`未找到版本 {0} 的已发布注释。`,"No stable releases have been published.":`尚未发布稳定版。`,"Not verified":`未验证`,Note:`注意`,"Note whether the issue survives restarting or using a simpler input.":`请注意问题是否在重新启动或使用更简单的输入后仍然存在。`,"Numeric region selection":`数字区域选择`,"OBJ or FBX":`OBJ 或 FBX`,"OBJ ZIP":`OBJ 邮政编码`,Off:`关闭`,"Offer catalog search":`提供目录搜索`,"Offer previews and metadata":`提供预览和元数据`,"Offline asset catalogs":`离线资产目录`,"Offline Marketplace catalog":`离线市场目录`,"Offline packet browser":`离线包浏览器`,On:`开`,"On restart, explicitly reopen the project files you need. The workspace does not automatically restore the previous session’s tab list.":`重新启动时,显式重新打开您需要的项目文件。工作区不会自动恢复上一个会话的选项卡列表。`,"On the receiving installation, open a copied world and start in a familiar area. Compare a pack-specific block, a container you expect to have inventory, and a second dimension if relevant. Save changes to the test copy after confirming it is the right world.":`在接收安装中,打开复制的世界并从熟悉的区域开始。比较特定于包的块、您期望有库存的容器以及第二个维度(如果相关)。确认测试副本是正确的世界后,保存对测试副本的更改。`,"On this page":`在本页`,"One region, three outputs":`一个区域,三个输出`,"Only into air":`仅进入空气`,"Only received chunks are available. Custom visuals depend on supplied definitions and readable packs.":`仅接收到的块可用。自定义视觉效果取决于提供的定义和可读包。`,Open:`开放`,"Open .mcstructure or extract a selected world region. Export .mcstructure, a portable project, or a new world copy.":`打开.mcstruct 或提取选定的世界区域。导出 .mcstruct、可移植项目或新的世界副本。`,"Open .pcap2 and supported inspection logs. Import detail depends on the available data.":`打开.pcap2并支持检查日志。导入详细信息取决于可用数据。`,"Open a Bedrock world directory or the installation’s world directory. Export a .mcworld or backup ZIP.":`打开基岩世界目录或安装的世界目录。导出 .mcworld 或备份 ZIP。`,"Open a desktop window":`打开桌面窗口`,"Open a local world":`打开本地世界`,"Open a map location in 3D":`打开 3D 地图位置`,"Open a saved visit, a Bedrock world folder, a `.mcworld` archive, or an existing studio project. Select the dimension and region you want to work with, and let terrain preparation finish before making final framing decisions.":"打开已保存的访问、基岩世界文件夹、`.mcworld` 存档或现有工作室项目。选择您想要使用的维度和区域,并在做出最终框架决策之前完成地形准备。","Open a sound to inspect the waveform, arrange clips, and listen to them together.":`打开声音检查波形、排列剪辑并一起聆听。`,"Open a structure":`打开结构`,"Open a supported session recording":`打开支持的会话录制`,"Open a supported sound from the asset library and inspect its waveform.":`从资源库中打开支持的声音并检查其波形。`,"Open a supported source":`打开支持的源`,"Open a world or a supported project. Export a still image or panorama, or save an editable .craftbox project.":`打开一个世界或支持的项目。导出静态图像或全景图,或保存可编辑的 .craftbox 项目。`,"Open an asset in the right workspace":`在右侧工作区中打开资产`,"Open an existing CraftBox recording in Packet Inspector or import a supported `.pcap2`, ProxyPass log, or ProxyWeb JSON file. Each open document has its own tab and retained selection.":"打开Packet Inspector 中的现有CraftBox 记录或导入受支持的`.pcap2`、ProxyPass 日志或ProxyWeb JSON 文件。每个打开的文档都有自己的选项卡和保留的选择。","Open an existing recording or supported diagnostic export.":`打开现有记录或支持的诊断导出。`,"Open an existing world from the Start workspace and work on a small, recognizable region first. It makes it easier to confirm that terrain, dimension, and textures loaded as expected.":`从“开始”工作区打开一个现有世界,并首先在一个小的、可识别的区域上工作。它可以更轻松地确认地形、尺寸和纹理是否按预期加载。`,"Open an issue with the version, platform, and steps to reproduce. Include a short, redacted log excerpt when it helps explain the issue.":`打开一个包含版本、平台和重现步骤的问题。如果有助于解释问题,请添加简短的、经过编辑的日志摘录。`,"Open an item to view its description, images, supported model preview, price, rating, or technical identifiers. The desktop can show a 3D preview when the offer includes a supported texture and compatible geometry.":`打开项目即可查看其描述、图像、支持的型号预览、价格、评级或技术标识符。当产品包含受支持的纹理和兼容的几何体时,桌面可以显示 3D 预览。`,"Open an online source, inspect offers and collections, and understand the limits of saved favorites.":`打开在线资源,检查优惠和收藏,并了解已保存收藏夹的限制。`,"Open Cinematic editor for a timed shot. Its scene view shows keyframes and paths, while the program monitor shows what the sequence plays. Reuse the same lighting and atmosphere as your still if you want the results to match.":`打开电影编辑器进行定时拍摄。它的场景视图显示关键帧和路径,而节目监视器显示序列播放的内容。如果您希望结果匹配,请重复使用与静止图像相同的灯光和氛围。`,"Open GitHub Issues":`开放GitHub问题`,"Open GitHub Releases to check current downloads, or try loading the catalog again.":`打开GitHub Releases 检查当前下载,或尝试再次加载目录。`,"Open local logs":`打开本地日志`,"Open Marketplace inside CraftBox Desktop and choose an available featured server or Experience from Discovery. Sign in to an eligible account in the desktop if requested. The catalog is scoped to the selected supported sources and their published associations.":`打开 CraftBox 桌面内的 Marketplace,然后从 Discovery 中选择可用的特色服务器或体验。如果需要,请在桌面上登录符合条件的帐户。该目录的范围为选定的支持源及其已发布的关联。`,"Open menu":`打开菜单`,"Open Merge worlds from the recording window. Add source tabs or saved regions as separate placements, then inspect their X, Y, and Z offsets in the preview. Use chunk snapping or an exact gap if your regions should line up.":`从录制窗口打开合并世界。将源选项卡或保存的区域添加为单独的位置,然后在预览中检查它们的 X、Y 和 Z 偏移。如果您的区域需要对齐,请使用块对齐或精确间隙。`,"Open or save an editable project":`打开或保存可编辑项目`,"Open Packets and narrow the list with the recorded type or timestamp range.":`打开数据包并使用记录类型或时间戳范围缩小列表范围。`,"Open Resource packs or Player skins. Import a local file or select a captured item. Search, tag, favorite, and inspect duplicate or related versions before deciding which item to export.":`打开资源包或玩家皮肤。导入本地文件或选择捕获的项目。在决定导出哪个项目之前,搜索、标记、收藏并检查重复或相关版本。`,"Open supported pack sounds inside the asset preview workspace.":`在资源预览工作区中打开支持的声音包。`,"Open supported published collections and creator-scoped relationships.":`打开支持的已发布集合和创建者范围的关系。`,"Open the exported `.mcworld` with Bedrock on the destination device and verify the expected dimensions, inventories, and packs. Open a copy in Render editor when you only need to compose an image from the terrain.":"在目标设备上使用 Bedrock 打开导出的 `.mcworld`,并验证预期的尺寸、库存和包装。当您只需要从地形合成图像时,请在渲染编辑器中打开副本。","Open the final world, model, image, or video in the receiving software and verify the essential details.":`在接收软件中打开最终的世界、模型、图像或视频并验证基本细节。`,"Open the intended library item and select the exact object or variant.":`打开所需的库项目并选择确切的对象或变体。`,"Open the live map from Worlds and follow received terrain.":`打开世界中的实时地图并遵循收到的地形。`,"Open the offer in the relevant source and environment.":`在相关来源和环境中打开报价。`,"Open the original Bedrock world or a richer project copy when the workflow needs the original source.":`当工作流程需要原始源时,打开原始基岩世界或更丰富的项目副本。`,"Open the world in Render editor. Confirm that the selected dimension contains the terrain you intended to use.":`在渲染编辑器中打开世界。确认所选维度包含您要使用的地形。`,"Open Worlds and choose a supported source. Complete the desktop device-code flow only when your selected source needs it. Use the local connection details shown by CraftBox when joining from Minecraft.":`打开世界并选择受支持的来源。仅当您选择的源需要时才完成桌面设备代码流程。从 Minecraft 加入时,使用 CraftBox 显示的本地连接详细信息。`,"Open Worlds, select a source, and let CraftBox resolve its connection details. Supported workflows can use a custom address, a Realm, a friend’s session, a featured server, or an Experience that the selected account can access.":`开放世界,选择一个来源,然后让CraftBox解析其连接详细信息。支持的工作流程可以使用自定义地址、领域、朋友的会话、特色服务器或所选帐户可以访问的体验。`,"Open-source tools for Minecraft Bedrock worlds.":`Minecraft Bedrock 世界的开源工具。`,"Operating system and CPU":`操作系统和CPU`,Option:`选项`,"Options that retain only prepared geometry can omit raw Atlas data and source-region operations.":`仅保留准备好的几何图形的选项可以省略原始 Atlas 数据和源区域操作。`,"Orbit or fly through terrain, select a render region, and pick a focus point.":`轨道或飞行穿过地形,选择渲染区域,然后选取焦点。`,"Orbit or move the camera until the area you want is visible. Use a faster preview mode while moving.":`旋转或移动相机,直到您想要的区域可见。移动时使用更快的预览模式。`,"Orbit the scene or move with the viewport’s free camera.":`绕场景旋转或使用视口的自由相机移动。`,"Organize shots, inspect camera paths, and preview the timing before export.":`组织镜头、检查摄像机路径并在导出前预览时间。`,"Other or unspecified":`其他或未指定`,"Other versions":`其他版本`,Output:`输出`,"Output and format behavior":`输出和格式行为

当记录的像素可用时,`,"Output map tiles and assembled walls when the recorded pixels are available.":`输出地图图块和组合墙。`,"Overlap handling":`重叠处理`,Overlay:`叠加`,"Pack archive handling":`包存档处理`,"Pack bindings and warnings in Resource packs or the render inspector.":`在 Resource packs 或渲染检查器中查看资源包绑定和警告。`,"Pack dependency report":`包依赖性报告`,"Pack export behavior":`打包导出行为`,"Pack file inspection":`包装文件检查`,"Pack inspection can show files, textures, supported 3D objects, and audio.":`包检查可以显示文件、纹理、支持的 3D 对象和音频。`,"Pack library handoff":`包库交接`,"Pack missing in a local copy":`本地副本中缺少包`,"Pack model":`包装型号`,"Pack overrides and face inspection":`包装覆盖和面部检查`,"Pack preview follows source files and supported runtime features. Missing source data requires a different authorized pack or capture that contains it.":`包预览遵循源文件和支持的运行时功能。缺少源数据需要包含它的不同授权包或捕获。`,"Pack sounds and waveforms":`资源包音效与波形`,"Pack-dependent visuals still need compatible assets where used.":`依赖包的视觉效果仍然需要使用兼容的资源。`,"Packet Inspector":`Packet Inspector`,Packs:`包`,"Packs, skins & models":`资源包、皮肤和模型`,"Packs, skins and editable models":`包、皮肤和可编辑模型`,Page:`页`,"Page not found":`找不到页面`,Pages:`页数`,"Pan and zoom a live tile map. A comparable raw-chunk inspector was not found.":`平移和缩放实时图块地图。没有找到类似的原始块检查器。`,"Panorama output":`全景输出`,"Pass `-h` after a command to check the flags, types, and defaults for that particular command. Quote paths containing spaces. Use explicit values when an option needs a different behavior than the command default.":"在命令后传递 `-h` 以检查该特定命令的标志、类型和默认值。引用包含空格的路径。当选项需要与命令默认值不同的行为时,请使用显式值。","Pick an image or panorama format":`选择图像或全景格式`,"Pick an overlay":`选择叠加层`,"Pick featured servers and Experiences as capture sources.":`选择特色服务器和体验作为捕获源。`,"Pick the right build, open your first world, and save a project you can return to.":`选择正确的构建,打开你的第一个世界,并保存一个可以返回的项目。`,"Pick the subject in the viewport and adjust depth of field or miniature scale.":`在视口中选取主体并调整景深或微型比例。`,"Pin an observation as the comparison reference and select a second observation.":`将一个观察值固定为比较参考并选择第二个观察值。`,"Place and label points, choose symbols, and retain map presentation in supported projects.":`在支持的项目中放置和标记点、选择符号并保留地图呈现。`,"Place named markers for points you want to revisit or annotate.":`为您想要重新访问或注释的点放置命名标记。`,"Place subsequent captured worlds inside the first using generated dimensions.":`使用生成的维度将后续捕获的世界放置在第一个世界中。`,"Place supported point, spot, or area lights around the subject.":`在拍摄对象周围放置受支持的点光、聚光灯或区域光。`,"Place, fill, replace, rotate, and mirror blocks using a palette, selections, and layers.":`使用调色板、选区和图层放置、填充、替换、旋转和镜像块。`,"Placement in a local world copy":`放置在本地世界副本中`,"Placement into a separate world copy":`放置到单独的世界副本中`,"Places source blocks only where the destination is empty.":`仅将源块放置在目标为空的位置。`,Platform:`平台`,"Platforms and distribution":`平台和发行`,"Play the available sounds while comparing pack versions or reviewing an asset.":`在比较包版本或查看资产时播放可用的声音。`,"Play the move, then adjust timing and curves on the channels that need correction.":`播放该动作,然后在需要校正的通道上调整时序和曲线。`,"Player models and equipment":`玩家模型和装备`,"Player skin":`玩家皮肤`,"Player skin previews can expose pose, geometry, available clothing layers, and appearance variants.":`玩家皮肤预览可以显示姿势、几何形状、可用的服装层和外观变体。`,"Player skins":`玩家皮肤`,"Player-skin capture":`玩家皮肤捕捉`,"PlayerAdd can override the default player inclusion decision. Other handlers expose captured game events.":`PlayerAdd 可以覆盖默认的玩家包含决策。其他处理程序公开捕获的游戏事件。`,Players:`玩家`,"PNG and other image formats":`PNG等图像格式`,"PNG map art exports the observed tiles. It is a rendered image, separate from the editable world.":`PNG 地图艺术导出观察到的图块。它是一个渲染图像,与可编辑的世界分开。`,"Portable blueprint projects":`便携式蓝图项目`,"Portable project contract":`便携式项目合同`,"Portable project format":`便携式项目格式`,"Portable scene projects":`便携式场景项目`,"Portable structure projects":`便携式结构项目`,"Portable studio projects":`便携式工作室项目`,"Precise selections":`精准选择`,"Prepare a cinematic sequence":`准备电影序列`,"Prepare a copy and remove account tokens, device codes, player identifiers, addresses you cannot share, local paths, and unrelated content. Inspect screenshots and attached filenames as well as visible log text.":`准备一份副本并删除帐户令牌、设备代码、玩家标识符、无法共享的地址、本地路径和不相关的内容。检查屏幕截图和附加文件名以及可见的日志文本。`,"Prepare a redacted diagnostics report":`准备一份经过编辑的诊断报告`,"Prepare a region":`准备一个区域`,"Prepare a safe diagnostic report":`准备一份安全的诊断报告`,"Prepare and browse a data snapshot using supported installations or sources.":`使用支持的安装或源准备和浏览数据快照。`,"Prepare diagnostic information":`准备诊断信息`,"Preserve gaps explicitly during extraction and choose how to export unknown cells.":`在提取过程中显式保留间隙并选择如何导出未知细胞。`,"Preserve model scale and file companions":`保留模型比例和文件同伴`,"Preserve supported inventory data received during capture.":`保留捕获期间收到的支持的库存数据。`,"Preserve unknown cells and directional states":`保留未知细胞和方向状态`,Preserves:`蜜饯`,Preview:`预览版`,"Preview and export depend on the material, geometry, and texture bindings in available source files.":`预览和导出取决于可用源文件中的材质、几何图形和纹理绑定。`,"Preview compatible geometry and poses or extract the relevant parts for export.":`预览兼容的几何体和姿势或提取相关部件进行导出。`,"Preview occupied-block conflicts and confirm the staged composition before exporting.":`预览占用块冲突并在导出前确认分阶段合成。`,"Preview offsets and collisions. Later occupied source blocks win in merge order.":`预览偏移和碰撞。后来被占用的源块按合并顺序获胜。`,"Preview pack sounds":`预览包声音`,"Preview quality":`预览质量`,"Preview supported images or sounds and export decoded audio where available.":`预览支持的图像或声音,并导出解码的音频(如果可用)。`,"Preview the chosen dimensions and chunk bounds. Fix overlapping targets or an empty result before submitting the copy.":`预览所选尺寸和块边界。在提交副本之前修复重叠的目标或空结果。`,"Preview the copy from the completed world’s export settings. The export validates retained dimensions, chunk overlap, and player or spawn locations. Use the preview to determine which rule blocks the copy.":`预览已完成的世界导出设置中的副本。导出会验证保留的尺寸、块重叠以及玩家或生成位置。使用预览来确定阻止复制的规则。`,"Preview the transition and check exposure and roll from one keyframe to the next.":`预览过渡并检查曝光并从一个关键帧滚动到下一关键帧。`,"Privacy-aware inspection":`隐私意识检查`,"Process a recorded visit without a joining client or select the viewing workflow.":`在没有加入客户的情况下处理记录的访问或选择查看工作流程。`,Product:`产品`,"Production and Staging":`制作和演出`,Project:`项目`,"Project contents by editor":`编辑的项目内容`,"Project type":`项目类型`,Protected:`受保护`,"Publication date unavailable":`出版日期不详`,"Published build workflow":`已发布的构建工作流程`,"Published GitHub release notes":`已发布 GitHub 发行说明`,"Published releases":`已发布版本`,"Published Windows, Linux, and macOS CLI variants run in a terminal.":`已发布的 Windows、Linux 和 macOS CLI 变体在终端中运行。`,Quickstart:`快速入门`,"Raw session recording":`原始会话录制`,"Read advertised command metadata in Command Explorer or use the local desktop console.":`读取Command Explorer 中公布的命令元数据或使用本地桌面控制台。`,"Read changes in terrain height at a glance.":`地形高度变化一目了然。`,"Read the asset export guide":`阅读资产导出指南`,"Read the atlas":`阅读图集`,"Read the Atlas, measure and mark terrain, export a map, and compose regions into a separate world.":`阅读地图集,测量和标记地形,导出地图,并将区域组成一个单独的世界。`,"Read the complete capture workflow":`阅读完整的捕捉工作流程`,"Read the CraftBox guide":`阅读 CraftBox 指南`,"Read the dependency report from the top-level active pack list down through nested dependencies. A pack with the same display name can have a different UUID or version. Match the requested identity together with its type before relying on the copy.":`从顶级活动包列表向下通过嵌套依赖项读取依赖项报告。具有相同显示名称的包可以有不同的 UUID 或版本。在依赖副本之前,将请求的身份与其类型相匹配。`,"Read the guide":`阅读指南`,"Read the log session status before opening files":`打开文件前读取日志会话状态`,"Read the mapping guide":`阅读地图指南`,"Read the original CraftBox comparison":`阅读原文CraftBox对比`,"Read the pack report and test the world on the intended receiving client. A received definition may still depend on a missing pack.":`阅读包报告并在预期接收客户端上测试世界。收到的定义可能仍然取决于丢失的包。`,"Read the primary repository reference":`阅读主存储库参考`,"Read the release notes":`阅读发行说明`,"Read the rendering guide":`阅读渲染指南`,"Read the static model format notes":`阅读静态模型格式注释`,"Read the Structure Studio guide":`阅读 Structure Studio 指南`,"Read the studio project storage options":`阅读工作室项目存储选项`,"Read Traffic without overstating the evidence":`阅读流量而不夸大证据`,"Read what the project file retains":`读取项目文件保留的内容`,"Reading comparison results":`读取对比结果`,"Reading session status":`读取会话状态`,"Readme.md#archive":`自述文件.md#archive`,"Readme.md#audio-studio":`自述文件.md#audio-studio`,"Readme.md#capturing-and-replaying-with-pcap2":`Readme.md#capturing-and-replaying-with-pcap2`,"Readme.md#command-line-and-scripting":`Readme.md#命令行和脚本`,"Readme.md#compatibility":`自述文件.md#兼容性`,"Readme.md#downloads":`自述文件.md#downloads`,"Readme.md#drawing-worlds-and-exporting-map-art":`Readme.md#drawing-worlds-and-exporting-map-art`,"Readme.md#player-skins":`自述文件.md#player-skins`,"Readme.md#using-the-command-line":`Readme.md#使用命令行`,"Readme.md#using-the-gui":`Readme.md#using-the-gui`,"Readme.md#working-with-blockbench":`自述文件.md#working-with-blockbench`,"Readme.md#worlds":`自述文件.md#worlds`,"Realm Stories prompt":`领域故事提示`,"Received terrain":`接收到的地形`,"Recent and pinned projects":`最近和固定的项目`,"Recent and suggested pages":`最近和建议的页面`,"Recent connection sources are available in its capture workflow.":`最近的连接源可在其捕获工作流程中使用。`,"Recent server entries and remembered options are available in the Gio workflow.":`Gio 工作流程中提供了最近的服务器条目和记住的选项。`,"Recent sources":`最近来源`,"Recently viewed":`最近查看`,"Record differences between the source and the saved world":`记录源世界和保存世界之间的差异`,"Record the app version and the smallest set of steps that produced the issue.":`记录应用程序版本以及产生问题的最小步骤集。`,"Record the context":`记录上下文`,"Record the editing format alongside the final delivery. Reopen a `.craftbox` master in its original workspace. Save a separate `.mcworld`, static model, or finished media file when the next tool needs that format.":"在最终交付的同时记录编辑格式。在其原始工作区中重新打开`.craftbox`母版。当下一个工具需要该格式时,保存单独的 `.mcworld`、静态模型或完成的媒体文件。","Record the exact source and receiving setup":`记录准确的来源和接收设置`,"Recorded field comparison":`记录字段对比`,"Recorded forms and scoreboards":`记录表格和记分板`,"Recorded menus and scoreboards":`录制的菜单和记分牌`,"Recording library":`录音库`,"Recordings and diagnostics":`记录和诊断`,"Recordings are saved as files and can be reopened for replay.":`录音保存为文件,可以重新打开重播。`,"Recover from a cancelled save":`从取消的保存中恢复`,Reference:`参考`,"Refresh the analysis explicitly when you need its latest retained data. Offline playback analyzes the selected recording prefix.":`当您需要最新保留的数据时显式刷新分析。离线播放会分析所选的录音前缀。`,"Refreshing release metadata…":`刷新发布元数据...`,"Region and crop behavior":`区域和作物行为`,"Related asset evidence":`相关资产证据`,"Related diagnostics and redaction":`相关诊断和编辑`,"Related features":`相关功能`,"Related guides":`相关指南`,"Related repository reference":`相关存储库参考`,"Related workflow":`相关工作流程`,Release:`发布`,"Release build workflow":`发布构建流程`,"Release data retrieved {0}.":`发布数据获取于 {0}。`,"Release metadata is temporarily unavailable.":`发布元数据暂时不可用。`,"Release notes":`发行说明`,"Release-channel controls":`发布通道控制`,Releases:`发布`,"Remove private details":`移除隐私信息`,Render:`渲染`,"Render a 2:1 panorama with its own resolution choice.":`使用自己的分辨率选择渲染 2:1 全景图。`,"Render a local world":`渲染本地世界`,"Render a local world as a top-down map or export a textured GLB with a prepared asset catalog.":`将本地世界渲染为自上而下的地图,或使用准备好的资产目录导出纹理GLB。`,"Render a top-down PNG of available terrain through the command line.":`通过命令行自上而下渲染可用地形的PNG。`,"Render a world folder or .mcworld and select the dimension.":`渲染世界文件夹或.mcworld 并选择维度。`,"Render an existing world":`渲染已有世界`,"Render and animate a world":`渲染和动画世界`,"Render can write tiles and adjoining map walls from saved world data.":`渲染可以从保存的世界数据写入图块和相邻的地图墙。`,"Render editor":`渲染编辑器`,"Render from local data":`使用本地数据渲染`,"Render outputs, model files, and editable projects preserve different data. Supported video containers depend on the desktop encoder.":`渲染输出、模型文件和可编辑项目保留不同的数据。支持的视频容器取决于桌面编码器。`,"Render project":`渲染项目`,"Render supported sign data and hanging signs into textured model output.":`将支持的标志数据和悬挂标志渲染到纹理模型输出中。`,"Render, Cinematic, and other document workspaces keep independent tabs. Switching a tab retains its current unsaved changes. Closing a dirty document offers Save, Discard, or Cancel. Wait for the save to finish before closing an editor or moving the file.":`渲染、电影和其他文档工作区保留独立的选项卡。切换选项卡会保留其当前未保存的更改。关闭脏文档可以选择“保存”、“放弃”或“取消”。等待保存完成,然后再关闭编辑器或移动文件。`,"Render, sequence, structure, and supported libraries have independent document state.":`渲染、序列、结构和支持的库具有独立的文档状态。`,"Rendered frames and supported audio":`渲染帧和支持的音频`,"Rendered pixels, with alpha in supported formats":`渲染像素,带有受支持格式的 alpha`,"rendering audits":`渲染审核`,"Renders & video":`渲染图和视频`,"Reopen the saved file and compare the selected view, layout, named regions, and scene settings. A geometry-only project can have a Rendered map while lacking raw Atlas data, so inspect the specific mode you intend to use later.":`重新打开保存的文件并比较所选视图、布局、命名区域和场景设置。仅几何图形的项目可以具有渲染地图,但缺少原始 Atlas 数据,因此请检查您稍后打算使用的特定模式。`,"Reorient a selection":`重新定向选择`,"Repeated world names are stored as separate visits. An empty visit creates no world archive.":`重复的世界名称存储为单独的访问。一次空虚的访问不会创造任何世界档案。`,"Replace all":`全部替换`,"Replace the example address with an authorized, compatible source. Join from Minecraft through the local CraftBox connection, then explore the required area. The command saves data received during that session.":`将示例地址替换为授权的兼容源。通过本地CraftBox连接从Minecraft加入,然后探索所需区域。该命令保存该会话期间收到的数据。`,"Replay recordings offline. A comparable graphical inspection workspace was not found.":`离线重播录音。未找到类似的图形检查工作区。`,"Replay without Minecraft":`无 Minecraft 重播`,"Report a reproducible issue":`报告可重现的问题`,"Report an issue":`报告问题`,"Repository documentation":`存储库文档`,"Repository screenshot":`存储库截图`,"Reproduce using an authorized source and save the exact steps.":`使用授权来源进行复制并保存确切的步骤。`,"Requirements and limits":`要求和限制`,"Reset filters":`重置筛选器`,"Resolve duplicate or overlapping target chunk choices before retrying.":`在重试之前解决重复或重叠的目标块选择。`,"Resolve pack dependencies by version":`按版本解决包依赖关系`,"Resolve required versions and nested dependencies or save a backup with a report.":`解决所需的版本和嵌套依赖关系或使用报告保存备份。`,"Resource pack library":`资源包库`,"Resource-pack capture":`资源包捕获`,Result:`结果`,"Result dimensions, density, transparent background, and annotations.":`结果尺寸、密度、透明背景和注释。`,"Retain available appearance, equipment, and player entity data when captured.":`捕获时保留可用的外观、装备和玩家实体数据。`,"Retain source data for operations that need the Bedrock database.":`保留需要基岩数据库的操作的源数据。`,"Retained diagnostic sessions":`保留的诊断会话`,"Retained observations, timing, and fields available to the codec.":`保留的观察结果、时序和可供编解码器使用的字段。`,"Retained payloads and headers. Decoding depends on the installed codec and captured data.":`保留的有效负载和标头。解码取决于安装的编解码器和捕获的数据。`,"Retained payloads for supported offline inspection or processing":`保留有效负载以支持离线检查或处理`,Retry:`重试`,"Return to a favorite":`返回收藏夹`,"Reuse a block and state":`重用块和状态`,"Reuse lighting, atmosphere, and grading across still and sequence work.":`在静态和序列作品中重复使用灯光、氛围和调色。`,"Review added, removed, and changed fields. Incomplete or redacted values are marked, and privacy changes reset the saved reference.":`查看添加、删除和更改的字段。不完整或经过编辑的值会被标记,隐私更改会重置已保存的参考。`,"Review an authorized recording offline using its timeline, decoded fields, available bytes, and bookmarks.":`使用时间线、解码字段、可用字节和书签离线查看授权录制。`,"Review animation and sound limits":`查看动画和声音限制`,"Review authorized recordings, compare Minecraft data, and run repeatable tasks from the terminal.":`查看授权记录、比较 Minecraft 数据并从终端运行可重复任务。`,"Review chunk/dimension bounds, overlap, biome replacements, and retained spawn before saving a copy.":`在保存副本之前检查块/维度边界、重叠、生物群系替换和保留的生成。`,"Review dependencies":`检查依赖关系`,"Review item details and supported previews or compare offer metadata.":`查看商品详细信息和支持的预览或比较优惠元数据。`,"Review pending edits and save, discard, or cancel closing.":`查看待处理的编辑并保存、放弃或取消关闭。`,"Review quantities before exporting or printing the list for your build.":`在导出或打印构建列表之前检查数量。`,"Review the actual exported file at its intended size. Check transparency in the application that will use the image, play the whole video, and independently reopen a model if geometry or materials matter.":`查看实际导出的文件的预期大小。检查将使用图像的应用程序的透明度,播放整个视频,并在几何或材料重要时独立重新打开模型。`,"Review the camera move on the timeline, then choose the available encoder and output settings.":`查看时间轴上的摄像机移动,然后选择可用的编码器和输出设置。`,"Review the cinematic workflow":`回顾电影工作流程`,"Review the desktop connection status and record the exact step that fails.":`查看桌面连接状态并记录失败的具体步骤。`,"Review the geometry and texture bindings of a supported model.":`查看受支持模型的几何和纹理绑定。`,"Review the local firewall rules and whether another program already uses the address or port.":`检查本地防火墙规则以及其他程序是否已使用该地址或端口。`,"Review the reproduced forms, links between recorded pages, and scoreboard snapshots. Server-side actions remain on the original service.":`查看复制的表格、记录页面之间的链接以及记分板快照。服务器端操作保留在原始服务上。`,"Review the saved sibling world or archive before removing any older export.":`在删除任何旧的导出之前查看已保存的同级世界或存档。`,"Review the version and continue to export.":`检查版本并继续导出。`,"Review the world pack export and local dependency reports before troubleshooting textures.":`在对纹理进行故障排除之前查看世界包导出和本地依赖性报告。`,"Review time bins, retained bytes, direction, and observation counts. These figures describe the recording.":`查看时间段、保留字节、方向和观察计数。这些数字描述了录音。`,"Reviewed default":`已审核默认值`,"Reviewed repositories":`审查存储库`,"Rework supported pack or skin geometry in Blockbench.":`重新设计Blockbench 中支持的包或皮肤几何形状。`,"Rotate by 90° around Y or mirror around X or Z. Review unknown directional states before accepting the change.":`绕 Y 旋转 90° 或绕 X 或 Z 镜像。在接受更改之前检查未知的方向状态。`,"Rotate the panorama and balance its scene lighting separately from background brightness.":`旋转全景图并平衡其场景照明与背景亮度。`,"Run `render` with a Bedrock world folder or `.mcworld` archive and the path for the PNG. This command produces a top-down map. The interactive Render editor handles scene lighting and camera work.":"使用基岩世界文件夹或`.mcworld`存档以及PNG的路径运行`render`。该命令生成一个自上而下的地图。交互式渲染编辑器处理场景照明和相机工作。","Run a command":`运行命令`,"Run supported capture, render, and local inspection commands from a standalone executable.":`从独立可执行文件运行支持的捕获、渲染和本地检查命令。`,"Save `.craftbox` to keep the blueprint’s portable document state. Export `.mcstructure` when another Bedrock workflow needs the structure. Resolve unknown cells or explicitly export them as Structure Void where the dialog allows.":"保存`.craftbox` 以保持蓝图的可移植文档状态。当另一个 Bedrock 工作流程需要该结构时导出 `.mcstructure`。解析未知单元格或在对话框允许的情况下将其显式导出为 Structure Void。","Save `.craftbox` to reopen a studio document with its settings. Export `.mcworld` when you want Minecraft to import a world, and choose `.mcstructure` for a blueprint you intend to place or move.":"保存 `.craftbox` 以重新打开 Studio 文档及其设置。当您想要Minecraft导入世界时,导出`.mcworld`,并为您想要放置或移动的蓝图选择`.mcstructure`。\n\n当所需的包可用时,","Save a .mcworld when the required packs are available or use backup-only export with a dependency report.":`保存 .mcworld,或者使用仅备份导出和依赖性报告。`,"Save a .pcap2 alongside other capture outputs or use a recording-only command.":`将 .pcap2 与其他捕获输出一起保存或使用仅记录命令。

当您打算继续编辑时,请保存`,"Save a `.craftbox` document when you plan to continue editing. A portable Render or Cinematic project packages terrain scene pages, texture data, and editor settings. Keep a `.mcworld` separately when Minecraft needs to load the world itself.":"保存`.craftbox`文档。便携式渲染或电影项目打包地形场景页面、纹理数据和编辑器设置。当Minecraft需要加载世界本身时,单独保留一个`.mcworld`。\n\n在尝试照明或输出设置之前,先保存","Save a `.craftbox` project before experimenting with lighting or output settings.":"保存`.craftbox` 项目。","Save a first project so you can reopen the scene with the same terrain and settings.":`保存第一个项目,以便您可以使用相同的地形和设置重新打开场景。`,"Save a multitrack audio project":`保存多轨音频项目`,"Save a named region or send the selected area to the relevant export workflow.":`保存命名区域或将选定区域发送到相关导出工作流程。`,"Save a named selection or export an annotated PNG at a chosen density.":`以选定的密度保存命名选择或导出带注释的 PNG。`,"Save a new copy with the necessary source data and verify the required inspector or export action.":`保存包含必要源数据的新副本,并验证所需的检查器或导出操作。`,"Save an editable `.craftbox` project. Export a PNG as a separate deliverable and open both files once to verify the handoff.":`保存可编辑的\`.craftbox\` 项目。将 PNG 导出为单独的可交付成果,并打开两个文件一次以验证切换。

当您只需要世界的一部分时,`,"Save an individual region when you only need part of the world.":`保存单个区域。`,"Save and close protection":`保存并关闭保护`,"Save and reopen .craftbox projects. Export a separate delivery file for Minecraft or other editors.":`保存并重新打开.craftbox 项目。为 Minecraft 或其他编辑器导出单独的交付文件。`,"Save as a new copy and reopen the result before replacing a working export.":`保存为新副本并在替换工作导出之前重新打开结果。`,"Save block data, anchors, subregions, and supported metadata in a portable .craftbox file.":`将块数据、锚点、子区域和支持的元数据保存在可移植的 .craftbox 文件中。`,"Save downloadable server resource packs using the packs mode or command.":`使用packs模式或命令保存可下载的服务器资源包。`,"Save during play":`播放时保存`,"Save editable render, sequence, and structure documents and open them again in CraftBox.":`保存可编辑的渲染、序列和结构文档,并在 CraftBox 中再次打开它们。`,"Save observed skins to a managed desktop library.":`将观察到的皮肤保存到托管桌面库。`,"Save players with supported skins, equipment, capes, and mount relationships where available.":`为玩家提供受支持的皮肤、装备、斗篷和坐骑关系(如果有)。`,"Save portable studio projects":`保存便携式工作室项目`,"Save received chunks and open the completed visit from the Worlds library.":`保存收到的块并从世界库中打开已完成的访问。`,"Save supported installation data as versioned snapshots.":`将支持的安装数据保存为版本快照。`,"Save terrain delivered during play and browse the resulting world files.":`保存游戏过程中传送的地形并浏览生成的世界文件。`,"Save the copy":`保存副本`,"Save the current visit and continue with another world segment.":`保存当前访问并继续另一个世界部分。`,"Save the sequence with its scene or export with an encoder available on the current desktop.":`保存序列及其场景或使用当前桌面上可用的编码器导出。`,"Save the terrain your Bedrock client receives during a visit and review the captured world in the library.":`保存基岩客户端在访问期间收到的地形,并在库中查看捕获的世界。`,"Saved CubeCraft visit in Worlds":`已保存 CubeCraft 世界赛访问`,"Saved favorites carry identifiers. Offer data comes from the online catalog.":`已保存的收藏夹带有标识符。报价数据来自在线目录。`,"Saved visit":`已保存访问`,"Scene frame":`场景框架`,"Scene geometry, atlas textures, camera pose, looks, lighting, and map presentation.":`场景几何、图集纹理、相机姿势、外观、照明和地图呈现。`,"Scene lights":`场景灯`,"Scene looks":`场景外观`,"Scene pages and editor settings, plus original terrain if selected.":`场景页面和编辑器设置,以及原始地形(如果选择)。`,"Screenshot points":`截图点数`,"Scroll to Start with a Bedrock world":`滚动到从基岩世界开始`,"Search assets by tag or provenance, save favorites, and review variants or copies.":`按标签或出处搜索资产、保存收藏夹以及查看变体或副本。`,"Search available command names and inspect advertised overloads and parameters.":`搜索可用的命令名称并检查公布的重载和参数。`,"Search categories":`搜索类别`,"Search CraftBox":`搜索 CraftBox`,"Search CraftBox (/)":`搜索 CraftBox (/)`,"Search for a guide or feature, or return to the CraftBox home page.":`搜索指南或功能,或返回CraftBox主页。`,"Search guides and file formats":`搜索指南和文件格式`,"Search guides, features, or versions":`搜索指南、功能或版本`,"Search results":`搜索结果`,"Search saved observations by type, direction, and time and inspect available decoded fields.":`按类型、方向和时间搜索保存的观察结果并检查可用的解码字段。`,"Search the tab’s command history.":`搜索选项卡的命令历史记录。`,"See CraftBox in action":`查看 CraftBox 的实际应用`,Select:`选择`,"Select a currency before sorting by price. Offers can present alternative currencies, composite costs, or different durations.":`在按价格排序之前选择一种货币。报价可以提供替代货币、综合成本或不同的期限。`,"Select a row to see available decoded fields and its time. Narrow the list by packet type, direction, or recording window. Use bookmarks to keep a short sequence of reference points for a support report.":`选择一行以查看可用的解码字段及其时间。按数据包类型、方向或记录窗口缩小列表范围。使用书签来保留支持报告的简短参考点序列。`,"Select a supported object from the model or file view. Check geometry and texture bindings. Use Extract model parts when you only need part of the object. Resolve missing bindings using the source pack rather than assuming one visually similar asset can replace another.":`从模型或文件视图中选择支持的对象。检查几何和纹理绑定。当您只需要对象的一部分时,请使用提取模型部分。使用源包解决丢失的绑定,而不是假设一个视觉上相似的资源可以替换另一个。`,"Select a time bucket to narrow the recorded packet list to that interval.":`选择一个时间段,将记录的数据包列表缩小到该时间间隔。`,"Select and copy the command manually.":`手动选择并复制命令。`,"Select around the part of the world you want to keep.":`选择您想要保留的世界部分。`,"Select retained world bounds, frame a shot, and adjust lens and focus.":`选择保留的世界边界、构图并调整镜头和焦距。`,"Select the world folder or archive and let the terrain load. Select the dimension when the source offers more than one.":`选择世界文件夹或存档并加载地形。当来源提供多个维度时,请选择维度。`,"Selected capture options and the appearance variants in Player skins.":`选定的捕捉选项和玩家皮肤中的外观变体。`,"Send a selected coordinate to the 3D viewer.":`将选定的坐标发送到 3D 查看器。`,"Separate map-art tiles from the terrain image":`将地图艺术图块与地形图像分开`,"Session status and available evidence":`会话状态和可用证据`,"Set a starting view and create a camera keyframe.":`设置起始视图并创建相机关键帧。`,"Set an anchor and write the blueprint into a separate world copy.":`设置锚点并将蓝图写入单独的世界副本。`,"Set camera keyframes, arrange shots and audio on a timeline, and render a video using the same scene lighting.":`设置相机关键帧,在时间轴上排列镜头和音频,并使用相同的场景照明渲染视频。`,"Set fog or cloud profiles, place cloud regions, and preserve clearance around the subject.":`设置雾或云轮廓,放置云区域,并保留拍摄对象周围的间隙。`,"Set precise bounds and inspect missing and retained chunks.":`设置精确的边界并检查丢失和保留的块。`,"Set the capture options":`设置捕捉选项`,"Set the light, sky, and focus for a still. Open the same scene in Cinematic editor to animate a camera path and arrange shots.":`设置静态照片的光线、天空和焦点。在电影编辑器中打开同一场景以设置摄像机路径动画并安排镜头。`,"Set the look":`设置外观`,"Set the playhead to the time where the shot should begin.":`将播放头设置为镜头应开始的时间。`,"Set the reference blueprint and its offset first. Then filter by missing, extra, changed, or incorrectly oriented blocks and isolate a layer when the 3D view is crowded.":`首先设置参考蓝图及其偏移量。然后按缺失、多余、更改或方向错误的块进行过滤,并在 3D 视图拥挤时隔离图层。`,"Set the two corners in local block coordinates and adjust them using the numbered inputs or viewport handles. Several selection boxes and named subregions can describe shapes that are not rectangular.":`在本地块坐标中设置两个角,并使用编号输入或视口手柄调整它们。多个选择框和命名子区域可以描述非矩形的形状。`,"Set up a camera, build a look, and choose a still, panorama, model, or cinematic output.":`设置相机,构建外观,然后选择静态、全景、模型或电影输出。`,"Set up the desktop app, find a command-line example, or choose a format for your export.":`设置桌面应用程序、查找命令行示例或选择导出格式。`,"Set which outputs and supported details CraftBox should collect for the session.":`设置CraftBox 应为会话收集哪些输出和支持的详细信息。`,Setting:`设置`,"Settle on the detail":`注重细节`,"Shadow controls":`阴影控制`,"Share a finished image or annotated map.":`分享完成的图像或带注释的地图。`,"Share a narrowly scoped, reviewed report when diagnosing an issue. Keep original recordings private.":`在诊断问题时分享一份范围狭窄、经过审查的报告。将原始录音保密。`,"Share a sequence using an available encoder.":`使用可用的编码器共享序列。`,"Share a short contextual excerpt rather than an entire account or capture directory.":`分享简短的上下文摘录,而不是整个帐户或捕获目录。`,"Share diagnostics safely":`安全共享诊断信息`,"Share the shortest excerpt that establishes the problem.":`分享确定问题的最短摘录。`,"Shared limits":`共享限制`,"Shared render styling":`共享渲染样式`,"Shared scene data plus the camera sequence, playhead, tracks, and other cinematic settings.":`共享场景数据以及摄像机序列、播放头、轨道和其他电影设置。`,"Shot and path editing":`镜头和路径编辑`,"Show {0}":`显示{0}`,"Show one building layer at a time to inspect the shape and orientation of its blocks.":`一次显示一个建筑层以检查其块的形状和方向。`,"Show or hide outer layers, adjust the pose, and inspect available cosmetics.":`显示或隐藏外层、调整姿势并检查可用的化妆品。`,"Showing {0} of {1} matches":`显示 {1} 条结果中的 {0} 条`,"Showing previously retrieved releases. Check GitHub for updates.":`显示以前检索到的版本。检查 GitHub 是否有更新。`,"Singleplayer world copy":`单人世界副本`,"Size unavailable":`尺寸不详`,"Skin texture editing":`皮肤纹理编辑`,"Skin variants and rig controls":`皮肤变体和装备控制`,"Skip to content":`跳到内容`,"Sky and environment":`天空与环境`,"Snapshot file browser":`快照文件浏览器`,Source:`来源`,"Sources for {0}":`{0} 来源`,"Sparse blocks, states, known and unknown regions, anchors, selections, view, and optional associated packs.":`稀疏块、状态、已知和未知区域、锚点、选择、视图和可选的关联包。`,"Sparse blueprint, block states, anchors, regions, and view settings.":`稀疏蓝图、方块状态、锚点、区域和视图设置。`,"Split or copy selected terrain and resolve a spawn inside a retained region.":`分割或复制选定的地形并解析保留区域内的生成。`,Stable:`稳定版`,"Stable and Preview builds for Windows, Linux, and macOS":`适用于 Windows、Linux 和 macOS 的稳定版和预览版`,"Stable and Preview release notes.":`稳定版和预览版发行说明。`,"Stable and Preview selection, release notes, and scheduled checks are built into preferences.":`稳定版和预览版选择、发行说明和计划检查均内置于首选项中。`,"Stage supported world exports and report missing or unreadable pack dependencies.":`Stage 支持世界导出并报告丢失或不可读的包依赖项。`,"Standalone capture commands are available through the in-game command interface.":`可以通过游戏内命令界面使用独立的捕获命令。`,"Standalone CLI":`独立 CLI`,"Start from a scene look or automatic direction suggestion, then refine and save the settings.":`从场景外观或自动方向建议开始,然后细化并保存设置。`,"Start from an existing look, then adjust sky, directional light, fog, clouds, water, exposure, and color. A preset is a starting point: review the final frame and turn grading off for a before-and-after check where available.":`从现有外观开始,然后调整天空、定向光、雾、云、水、曝光和颜色。预设是一个起点:检查最终帧并关闭分级以进行前后检查(如果可用)。`,"Start on a wide view so the full terrain establishes where the shot takes place.":`从宽阔的视野开始,以便完整的地形确定拍摄的位置。`,"Start with a Bedrock world":`从基岩世界开始`,"Start with a blank blueprint, import a file, or extract an area from a world.":`从空白蓝图开始,导入文件,或从世界中提取区域。`,"Start with a capture":`从捕捉开始`,"Start with an existing world":`从现有的世界开始`,"Static 3D model formats":`静态 3D 模型格式`,"Static model export works from the retained source region. It does not bake camera movement, atmosphere, or screen-space post effects.":`静态模型导出可从保留的源区域进行。它不会烘焙相机运动、氛围或屏幕空间后期效果。`,"Static model formats":`静态模型格式`,"Static models contain geometry and materials. Lighting and camera animation belong in a rendered image or video.":`静态模型包含几何体和材料。灯光和相机动画属于渲染图像或视频。`,Status:`状态`,STL:`STL`,"Stop the session or leave Minecraft and wait for the save to finish. Open the result folder or inspect the completed Worlds entry. If enabled, a map image or map-art outputs appear alongside the `.mcworld` archive.":"停止会话或离开Minecraft 并等待保存完成。打开结果文件夹或检查已完成的世界条目。如果启用,地图图像或地图艺术输出将显示在 `.mcworld` 存档旁边。","Stored state":`存储状态`,"Structure preview and native operations":`结构预览和原生操作`,"Structure Studio":`Structure Studio`,"Structure Studio rotates in 90° steps about Y. Mirror supports the X and Z axes.":`Structure Studio 围绕 Y 以 90° 为步长旋转。镜像支持 X 轴和 Z 轴。`,"Structure Studio views":`Structure Studio 观看次数`,"Studio and workspace file scope":`Studio 和工作区文件范围`,"Submit a useful report":`提交有用的报告`,"Suggested pages":`建议页面`,"Supported .pcap2":`支持.pcap2`,"Supported hierarchy, pivots, cubes, UVs, and embedded textures":`支持的层次结构、枢轴、立方体、UV 和嵌入纹理`,"Supported save workflows validate and publish a copy after staging.":`支持的保存工作流程在暂存后验证并发布副本。`,"Supported scene or blueprint data and editor settings":`支持的场景或蓝图数据和编辑器设置`,"Supported Windows installs can use the PowerShell-backed desktop terminal.":`支持的 Windows 安装可以使用PowerShell 支持的桌面终端。`,"Switch available clothing layers and review the captured custom geometry.":`切换可用的服装层并查看捕获的自定义几何形状。`,"Switch between coverage, biome, relief, contour, and grid overlays.":`在覆盖范围、生物群落、地形、轮廓和网格覆盖之间切换。`,"Switch to the desktop’s local command interface with /cli for supported app tasks.":`使用 /cli 切换到桌面的本地命令界面以执行支持的应用程序任务。`,"Switching dimensions or being transferred to another server can start a separate visit.":`切换维度或者转移到其他服务器可以开始单独访问。`,"Switching the catalog environment changes which data and favorites are in view.":`切换目录环境会更改视图中的数据和收藏夹。`,Symptom:`症状`,Tab:`标签`,"Take a model into another editor":`将模型放入另一个编辑器中`,"Take a supported Bedrock model into Blockbench with its bones, cubes, pivots, UVs and embedded textures.":`将受支持的基岩模型及其骨骼、立方体、枢轴、UV 和嵌入纹理放入Blockbench。`,Target:`目标`,Task:`任务`,"Tell a portable document from a library workspace":`区分可移植文档和库工作区`,Terrain:`地形`,"Terrain and supported exported world data":`地形和支持导出的世界数据`,"Terrain generators":`地形生成器`,"Terrain the client never received":`客户端从未收到过的地形`,"Test a copy with a known landmark":`使用已知地标测试副本`,"Test an exported world on the receiving Bedrock version before distributing a copy.":`在分发副本之前在接收基岩版本上测试导出的世界。`,"Test with a short local or authorized sample before relying on a large capture.":`在依赖大量捕获之前,使用简短的本地或授权样本进行测试。`,"Text log":`文本日志`,"Text, offer type, and tags can be sent to the catalog where supported. Price, currency, and compatibility can also filter the returned pages.":`文本、报价类型和标签可以发送到支持的目录。价格、货币和兼容性也可以过滤返回的页面。`,"Textured 3D worlds":`纹理 3D 世界`,"Textures or structures are missing":`纹理或结构丢失`,"The /cb menu groups capture, point, map, region, and blueprint commands.":`/cb 菜单对捕获、点、地图、区域和蓝图命令进行分组。`,"The `/save-world` command can save the current terrain and start another capture while the session stays connected. Consult the ingame command guide for the build you are running.":"`/save-world` 命令可以保存当前地形并在会话保持连接时开始另一次捕获。请参阅您正在运行的构建的游戏内命令指南。","The `render` command can export maps held in item frames as their own output. Use a distinct directory for map-art files and select a dimension supported by the world. `-no-image=true` suppresses the ordinary terrain PNG.":"`render` 命令可以将物品框中保存的地图导出为其自己的输出。对地图艺术文件使用不同的目录,并选择世界支持的维度。 `-no-image=true`压制普通地形PNG。","The Android GUI and APK release pipeline include Android-specific storage, world handoff, and session lifecycle code.":`Android GUI 和 APK 发布管道包括 Android 特定的存储、世界切换和会话生命周期代码。`,"The application logs and reports failures. An equivalent retained-session browser was not found.":`应用程序记录并报告故障。未找到等效的保留会话浏览器。`,"The Archive workspace reviews available installation data and snapshots. Supported formats and schemas determine how much it can interpret.":`存档工作区查看可用的安装数据和快照。支持的格式和架构决定了它可以解释的程度。`,"The best choice depends on what you plan to open next. Keep a CraftBox project for editing and export an additional file for Minecraft, Blockbench, or a rendered delivery.":`最佳选择取决于您接下来打算打开什么。保留 CraftBox 项目进行编辑,并导出用于 Minecraft、Blockbench 或渲染交付的附加文件。`,"The binary FBX and included texture images. The FBX 7.4 writer has a 4 GiB offset limit.":`二进制 FBX 和包含的纹理图像。 FBX 7.4 写入器的偏移量限制为 4 GiB。`,"The cinematic export accepts a frame rate, bitrate, audio setting, and timeline range. The resulting file starts at time zero for the chosen range. The included audio uses the original timeline offset.":`电影导出接受帧速率、比特率、音频设置和时间线范围。生成的文件从所选范围的零时间开始。包含的音频使用原始时间线偏移。`,"The CLI merge workflow has no equivalent visual placement editor.":`CLI 合并工作流程没有等效的视觉放置编辑器。`,"The command list includes chat-log and list-realms.":`命令列表包括聊天日志和列表领域。`,"The command-line world renderer writes PNG.":`命令行世界渲染器写为PNG。`,"The comparison overlay is part of the desktop Structure Studio.":`比较叠加是桌面Structure Studio的一部分。`,"The copy workflow preserves the original world. Cancelling or failing an export also preserves an existing output file.":`复制工作流程保留了原始世界。取消或失败导出也会保留现有的输出文件。`,"The CraftBox desktop README specifies an English interface. This review did not compare every inherited string.":`CraftBox 桌面自述文件指定了英文界面。该评论没有比较每个继承的字符串。`,"The CraftBox desktop start workspace with capture, open, and new project actions":`CraftBox 桌面启动工作区,包含捕获、打开和新建项目操作`,"The desktop app includes the visual studio. Use the CLI for terminal workflows.":`桌面应用程序包括 Visual Studio。使用 CLI 进行终端工作流程。`,"The desktop applications have different interfaces and distribution targets. The public CI targets and the presence of a build path are recorded separately.":`桌面应用程序有不同的界面和分布目标。公共 CI 目标和构建路径的存在是单独记录的。`,"The desktop documentation for the chosen build and distribution.":`所选版本和发行版的桌面文档。`,"The dimension flag is numeric for `render3d`. Use `0` for Overworld, `1` for Nether, or `2` for End. The top-down `render` command uses dimension names.":"`render3d` 的尺寸标志是数字。使用`0`代表主世界,`1`代表下界,或`2`代表末日。自上而下的`render`命令使用尺寸名称。","The executable for your OS and CPU. Terminal workflows use a different artifact from Desktop.":`适用于您的操作系统和 CPU 的可执行文件。终端工作流程使用与桌面不同的工件。`,"The export dialog of the desktop runtime on the machine that produces the video.":`生成视频的计算机上桌面运行时的导出对话框。`,"The exported world can include captured block states, available pack files, and supported entities. Each activated pack needs its matching manifest and version inside the archive.":`导出的世界可以包括捕获的方块状态、可用的包文件和支持的实体。每个激活的包都需要在存档中匹配清单和版本。`,"The exporter follows the selected source animation and controller graph. Missing dependencies are reported rather than guessed.":`导出器遵循选定的源动画和控制器图。缺失的依赖项是报告的而不是猜测的。`,"The following are the defaults in the reviewed world command. Review saved desktop settings or the help output of your release before relying on a default.":`以下是已审查的世界命令中的默认值。在依赖默认值之前,请检查已保存的桌面设置或版本的帮助输出。`,"The fountain blueprint is selected. The studio shows its block palette, selection properties, and layer controls.":`喷泉蓝图已选定。该工作室显示了其块调色板、选择属性和图层控件。`,"The Gio application groups connection settings and capture tools into modes.":`Gio 应用程序将连接设置和捕获工具分组为模式。

导出后的`,"The GUI presents captured packs and skins. No corresponding managed library was found.":`GUI 显示捕获的包和皮肤。未找到相应的托管库。`,"The Hive fox is shown in Blockbench after export, with its texture and editable model hierarchy.":`Hive 狐狸如图Blockbench 所示,具有纹理和可编辑的模型层次结构。`,"The Hive pack preview shows a selected model. The surrounding workspace gives access to pack files and export.":`Hive 包预览显示选定的模型。周围的工作区可以访问打包文件和导出。`,"The Hive world is shown in Render editor, with scene lighting and export controls alongside the viewport.":`Hive 世界显示在渲染编辑器中,场景照明和导出控件位于视口旁边。`,"The in-game save command starts a new saved world without leaving the session.":`游戏内保存命令无需离开会话即可启动新的保存世界。`,"The inherited actor utilities operate on saved world data.":`继承的 Actor 实用程序对保存的世界数据进行操作。`,"The inherited CLI exposes chat logging and Realm listing.":`继承的CLI公开聊天记录和领域列表。`,"The inherited merge command combines saved worlds through the terminal.":`继承的合并命令通过终端合并已保存的世界。`,"The inspector shows the metadata and assets the item publishes. A 3D preview appears when the item includes a compatible inline Bedrock model and its available HTTPS texture. A flat item or a missing model can still have price, description, and image information.":`检查器显示项目发布的元数据和资产。当该项目包含兼容的内联基岩模型及其可用的 HTTPS 纹理时,会出现 3D 预览。扁平的商品或缺失的型号仍然可以包含价格、描述和图像信息。`,"The library can reopen recovered or saved structures.":`库可以重新打开恢复或保存的结构。`,"The live Atlas reads captured chunk data in tiles. Use it to inspect what has been received without constructing a fully textured 3D scene. In Render editor, Atlas and Rendered views serve different jobs: one helps inspect terrain data and the other reflects the rendered model.":`Live Atlas 以图块形式读取捕获的块数据。使用它来检查收到的内容,而无需构建完全纹理化的 3D 场景。在渲染编辑器中,图集和渲染视图具有不同的作用:一个帮助检查地形数据,另一个反映渲染的模型。`,"The map renderer uses available local world data and packs.":`地图渲染器使用可用的本地世界数据和包。`,"The Marketplace workspace lists offers for the selected source.":`Marketplace 工作区列出了所选来源的商品。`,"The merge preserves the source worlds. The destination accepts Overworld Y levels from −64 to 319 and can reject incompatible pack definitions for the same identity.":`合并保留了源世界。目的地接受从-64到319的主世界Y级别,并且可以拒绝相同身份的不兼容的包定义。`,"The merge stages a separate world and counts occupied block conflicts. Air does not erase earlier terrain. When confirmed placements overlap, later placements win at those positions.":`合并阶段是一个单独的世界并计算占用的块冲突。空气不会抹去之前的地形。当确认的排名重叠时,较晚的排名将在这些位置上获胜。`,"The model export dialog can choose centered or world origin, positive scale, material and texture inclusion, and axes where the format permits them. Scale `1` is one unit per block. GLB and glTF stay Y-up.":"模型导出对话框可以选择居中或世界原点、正比例、材质和纹理包含以及格式允许的轴。规模`1`是每块一个单位。 GLB 和 glTF 保持 Y 向上。","The normal views and exports redact recognized private data. Original recordings still require private handling.":`正常查看并导出编辑识别的私有数据。原始录音仍需要私人处理。`,"The original pack, skin, or recording in the local library. Audio clips reference their original pack paths.":`本地库中的原始包、皮肤或录音。音频剪辑引用其原始包路径。`,"The overview and exported close-up come from the same candle rendering audit.":`概览和导出的特写来自相同的蜡烛渲染审核。`,"The overview and render editor use different documented worlds. The comparison uses two views of the same scene. Capture and editing run in CraftBox Desktop.":`概述和渲染编辑器使用不同的记录世界。该比较使用同一场景的两个视图。捕获和编辑在CraftBox桌面中运行。`,"The persistent logger creates separate sessions for the app and map windows. Entries include timestamps, severity, component, and context. A file flagged as truncated in the preview may still have earlier entries in the full local file.":`持久记录器为应用程序和地图窗口创建单独的会话。条目包括时间戳、严重性、组件和上下文。在预览中标记为截断的文件在完整的本地文件中可能仍具有较早的条目。`,"The Player skins workspace shows a captured custom model with geometry and appearance controls.":`玩家皮肤工作区显示捕获的带有几何和外观控件的自定义模型。`,"The preview can approximate supported runtime behavior. Some shader, particle, server-state, and animation features depend on data beyond the exported model.":`预览可以近似支持的运行时行为。某些着色器、粒子、服务器状态和动画功能依赖于导出模型之外的数据。`,"The preview follows exact pack UUIDs and versions, including transitive add-on dependencies. CraftBox looks in embedded packs, installed packs, development folders, and available template or premium folders.":`预览遵循精确的包 UUID 和版本,包括传递附加依赖项。 CraftBox 查找嵌入式包、已安装包、开发文件夹以及可用模板或高级文件夹。`,"The preview shows the last 128 KiB. Use the native log viewer action to access the full local file if you need earlier context.":`预览显示最后 128 KiB。如果您需要更早的上下文,请使用本机日志查看器操作访问完整的本地文件。`,"The recorded lines and inferred times. Original bytes or structured data may be absent.":`记录的线路和推断的时间。原始字节或结构化数据可能不存在。`,"The recorder turns observed forms and scoreboards into a generated behavior pack. Reconstructed interfaces retain recorded data.":`记录器将观察到的表格和记分板转化为生成的行为包。重建的接口保留记录的数据。`,"The render selection is an inclusive volume of the source. The file saved by a cropped project retains the selected region. A wider camera angle later can need terrain beyond that saved selection.":`渲染选择是源的包含体积。裁剪项目保存的文件保留所选区域。稍后更宽的摄像机角度可能需要超出已保存选择的地形。`,"The renderer can use its prepared vanilla asset catalog and supported local world data.":`渲染器可以使用其准备好的普通资产目录和支持的本地世界数据。`,"The renderer produces a top-down PNG from supported world inputs.":`渲染器根据支持的世界输入生成自上而下的PNG。`,"The renderer uses available terrain and supported pack geometry. Static model exports do not carry image post-processing.":`渲染器使用可用的地形和支持的包几何体。静态模型导出不进行图像后处理。`,"The repository’s comparison document uses an older upstream snapshot. Current shared rows reflect the reviewed upstream code, including generator controls, recorded interfaces, merged dimensions, and headless replay.":`存储库的比较文档使用较旧的上游快照。当前共享行反映了已审查的上游代码,包括生成器控件、记录的接口、合并的维度和无头重放。`,"The reviewed branch uses NetherNet. Exact game compatibility follows the chosen binary.":`被审核的分支使用NetherNet。确切的游戏兼容性遵循所选的二进制文件。`,"The reviewed cinematic exporter has a 190 MiB output limit. Reduce the range, dimensions, or bitrate if the estimate or result exceeds the budget.":`经过审查的电影导出器的输出限制为 190 MiB。如果估计或结果超出预算,则减小范围、维度或比特率。`,"The reviewed development branch uses NetherNet. CraftBox needs a compatible Minecraft client and a source that supports the same transport.":`审查的开发分支使用NetherNet。 CraftBox 需要兼容的 Minecraft 客户端和支持相同传输的源。`,"The reviewed Gio map is presented inside Worlds.":`经过审查的 Gio 地图显示在世界中。`,"The reviewed source did not establish an equivalent.":`审查的来源没有建立等效的。`,"The reviewed source provides this function.":`已审查的源提供了此功能。`,"The same input boundary applies to upstream capture.":`相同的输入边界适用于上游捕获。`,"The same observation can exist in a raw recording, a decoded view, or a text log. The available evidence depends on what the input retained.":`相同的观察结果可以存在于原始记录、解码视图或文本日志中。可用的证据取决于输入保留的内容。`,"The scene styling panel groups lighting, atmosphere, color, and detail settings.":`场景造型面板对灯光、氛围、颜色和细节设置进行分组。`,"The selected catalog environment and Discovery source scope the offer list. Production is the default. Staging can contain different entries and favorites. A source may publish offers or collections in one environment and have nothing available in another.":`选定的目录环境和发现源范围在商品列表中。生产是默认的。暂存可以包含不同的条目和收藏夹。来源可能会在一种环境中发布报价或集合,而在另一种环境中则没有任何内容。`,"The session ended without a normal marker or recognized crash report. It may contain useful preceding events.":`会话结束时没有正常标记或识别的崩溃报告。它可能包含有用的先前事件。`,"The session has a normal shutdown marker.":`会话有正常关闭标记。`,"The shared CLI commands remain useful independently of each project’s graphical interface.":`共享的 CLI 命令独立于每个项目的图形界面仍然有用。`,"The shared scripting model includes the PlayerAdd callback.":`共享脚本模型包括 PlayerAdd 回调。`,"The single `.glb` contains scene data and available textures.":"单个`.glb` 包含场景数据和可用纹理。","The skin editor saves an edited texture as a separate library item.":`皮肤编辑器将编辑后的纹理保存为单独的库项目。`,"The standalone terminal interface runs outside its GUI.":`独立终端界面在其 GUI 之外运行。`,"The start workspace lists available recent projects.":`开始工作区列出了最近可用的项目。`,"The studio can check Stable and Preview and offers installation with checksum verification when compatible.":`工作室可以检查稳定版和预览版,并在兼容时提供带有校验和验证的安装。`,"The top-down renderer reads available world packs.":`自上而下的渲染器读取可用的世界包。`,"The translucent comparison preview runs in Structure Studio. Placement writes a separate world copy.":`半透明对比预览在Structure Studio 中运行。放置会写入一个单独的世界副本。`,"The updater selects a matching GitHub artifact. Desktop and Android have separate install paths.":`更新程序选择匹配的 GitHub 工件。桌面版和 Android 版有单独的安装路径。`,"The website uses":`网站使用`,"The website walkthrough illustrates the interface. Native capture, sign-in, file dialogs, and exporting run in CraftBox Desktop.":`网站演练说明了界面。本机捕获、登录、文件对话框和导出在CraftBox桌面中运行。`,"The world setting and in-game generator control offer the same three choices.":`世界设置和游戏内生成器控制提供了相同的三种选择。`,"The world writer handles supported custom entities without that separate CraftBox setting.":`世界编写器无需单独的 CraftBox 设置即可处理支持的自定义实体。`,"The Worlds page includes an embedded live map for the current capture.":`世界页面包含当前捕获的嵌入式实时地图。`,"The Worlds workspace shows a saved visit, its available data, and the actions for importing, rendering, or exporting it.":`世界工作区显示已保存的访问、其可用数据以及导入、渲染或导出它的操作。`,"There are no published {0} releases in this catalog.":`此目录中没有已发布的 {0} 版本。`,"There is a related function with a different scope or delivery path.":`有一个具有不同范围或交付路径的相关功能。`,"This is a desktop console command after entering /cli. It is separate from the standalone executable command set.":`这是输入/cli后的桌面控制台命令。它与独立的可执行命令集是分开的。`,"This path gives you a first result without a live server session. Use a Bedrock world folder or a `.mcworld` archive you can open.":"此路径无需实时服务器会话即可为您提供第一个结果。使用可以打开的基岩世界文件夹或`.mcworld`存档。","This release does not include notes.":`此版本不包含注释。`,"This review does not establish the specific behavior.":`本次审查并未确定具体行为。`,"This workflow edits a separate blueprint document. Placement can create a new local world copy.":`此工作流程编辑单独的蓝图文档。放置可以创建一个新的本地世界副本。`,"To revise an existing keyframe without moving it in time, select it and update it from the current view.":`要修改现有关键帧而不及时移动它,请选择它并从当前视图中更新它。`,"Top-down renderer options":`自顶向下渲染器选项

即使示例和标记有上限,`,"Totals cover the result even when examples and markers are capped. The reviewed studio keeps up to 10,000 examples and 3,000 viewport markers.":`总计也能覆盖结果。经过审查的工作室保留了多达 10,000 个示例和 3,000 个视口标记。`,"Track supported media/export tasks and cancel them before publication.":`跟踪支持的媒体/导出任务并在发布前取消它们。`,"Traffic summaries":`交通汇总`,"Traffic summarizes the recorded endpoint’s observations by time, direction, type, and available payload size. A quiet bin says what was retained in that bin. It does not measure transport packet loss or latency.":`流量按时间、方向、类型和可用负载大小总结了记录的端点的观察结果。一个安静的垃圾箱会说出该垃圾箱中保留的内容。它不测量传输数据包丢失或延迟。`,"Traffic views summarize observations retained at the proxy. Separate directions and compare time ranges, taking note of any gaps or truncation reported by the recorder. Recorded counts describe the available capture. They cannot establish end-to-end delivery or latency.":`流量视图总结了代理处保留的观察结果。分开方向并比较时间范围,注意记录器报告的任何间隙或截断。记录的计数描述了可用的捕获。他们无法建立端到端交付或延迟。`,"Transfer a structure between Bedrock workflows.":`在 Bedrock 工作流程之间传输结构。`,"Transfer geometry and available visual materials for a static scene.":`传输静态场景的几何图形和可用的视觉材质。`,"Transfer static geometry using GLB, glTF, OBJ, FBX, or STL. Multi-file outputs are packaged together.":`使用GLB、glTF、OBJ、FBX 或 STL 传输静态几何体。多文件输出打包在一起。`,"Treat raw recordings as private, even when the normal viewer redacts sensitive fields.":`将原始录音视为私人录音,即使普通观众会编辑敏感字段。`,"Triangle geometry only. Check printability independently.":`仅限三角形几何体。独立检查适印性。`,"Triangle geometry only. Inspect and repair it in the target tool if you need a watertight print.":`仅限三角形几何体。如果您需要防水打印,请在目标工具中检查并修复它。`,"Troubleshoot missing assets and failed exports":`解决丢失资产和导出失败的问题`,Troubleshooting:`故障排除`,"Try a smaller region, lower preview quality, or a simpler output format. Use progress and cancellation where available and keep the current editable project before switching outputs. For video, check what the native desktop runtime can encode.":`尝试更小的区域、更低的预览质量或更简单的输出格式。在可用的情况下使用进度和取消,并在切换输出之前保留当前的可编辑项目。对于视频,请检查本机桌面运行时可以编码的内容。`,"Try Rendered view to inspect what the project retained.":`尝试渲染视图来检查项目保留的内容。`,"Turn captured terrain into stills, animated sequences, editable blueprints, or portable projects.":`将捕获的地形转换为静态图像、动画序列、可编辑蓝图或便携式项目。`,"Unavailable player model":`不可用的玩家模型`,"Unavailable prices are shown as unknown. A displayed price can contain multiple currency options.":`不可用的价格显示为未知。显示的价格可以包含多种货币选项。`,"Understand the differences between recordings and logs":`了解录音和日志的区别`,"Understand what each format keeps and choose the right output for your next tool.":`了解每种格式保留的内容,并为您的下一个工具选择正确的输出。`,"Understand world and pack fidelity":`了解世界和包装保真度`,"Undo an edit":`撤消编辑`,"Undo and redo":`撤消和重做`,"Unexpected GitHub release response.":`意外的GitHub 释放响应。`,Unknown:`未知`,"Unknown cells and Structure Void":`未知细胞和结构空洞`,"Unreceived chunks and private server logic are outside the capture. Optional forms and scoreboard recording reproduces received interface snapshots, while their original server-side actions require the original server.":`未接收到的块和私有服务器逻辑不在捕获范围内。可选的表单和记分板记录再现接收到的界面快照,而它们的原始服务器端操作需要原始服务器。`,"Up and Down":`上下`,"Update checks":`更新检查`,"Upstream maintains locale bundles in multiple languages. Coverage varies by locale.":`Upstream 维护多种语言的语言环境包。覆盖范围因地区而异。`,Use:`使用`,"Use `-dimension=nether` for a local world’s Nether map when that dimension exists.":"使用 `-dimension=nether` 作为本地世界的下界地图。","Use `render3d` with a Bedrock world folder and a prepared 3D asset catalog. This is a separate command from the top-down renderer. The GLB contains static geometry and available materials.":"将 `render3d` 与基岩世界文件夹和准备好的 3D 资产目录一起使用。这是与自顶向下渲染器不同的命令。 GLB 包含静态几何体和可用材料。","Use a Bedrock world folder or .mcworld file you already have. Import it for creative work or copy it with its available packs.":`使用基岩世界文件夹或已有的 .mcworld 文件。导入它以进行创造性工作或使用其可用包复制它。`,"Use a captured or imported scene. Save an editable .craftbox project or render with an available video encoder.":`使用捕获或导入的场景。保存可编辑的 .craftbox 项目或使用可用的视频编码器进行渲染。`,"Use a distance path to measure a route.":`使用距离路径来测量路线。`,"Use a named region to limit the amount of terrain or preserve a smaller subject.":`使用命名区域来限制地形数量或保留较小的主题。`,"Use a saved recording you are authorized to inspect. Pick a relevant observation, pin it as the reference, and compare it with a related observation in the same local workspace.":`使用您有权检查的已保存录音。选择相关观察,将其固定为参考,并将其与同一本地工作区中的相关观察进行比较。`,"Use a scene, region, model, or timeline as the source. Choose the file type for the target editor or viewer.":`使用场景、区域、模型或时间轴作为源。选择目标编辑器或查看器的文件类型。`,"Use a source you have permission to capture.":`使用您有权捕获的来源。`,"Use an authorized source. Confirm the local connection and check received terrain before ending the visit.":`使用授权来源。在结束访问之前确认本地连接并检查接收到的地形。`,"Use an editable export to preserve the authored hierarchy and source definitions. Choose a baked output if the recipient only needs the current displayed shape or deformation.":`使用可编辑导出来保留创作的层次结构和源定义。如果接收者只需要当前显示的形状或变形,请选择烘焙输出。`,"Use capture coverage to check terrain completeness.":`使用捕获覆盖范围来检查地形完整性。`,"Use Ctrl+Z, or redo with Ctrl+Y or Ctrl+Shift+Z where the editor has focus.":`使用 Ctrl+Z,或者在编辑器具有焦点的地方使用 Ctrl+Y 或 Ctrl+Shift+Z 重做。`,"Use filtered console tabs, history, completion, and the local /cli workflow.":`使用过滤的控制台选项卡、历史记录、完成和本地 /cli 工作流程。`,"Use Find packs when a readable folder is missing from discovery. The preview distinguishes available dependencies from missing, ambiguous, or protected content.":`当发现中缺少可读文件夹时,请使用查找包。预览将可用的依赖项与缺失、不明确或受保护的内容区分开来。`,"Use for compatible entity geometry. Some multi-material or polygon data needs Generic Model.":`用于兼容的实体几何体。一些多材质或多边形数据需要通用模型。`,"Use for supported blocks and per-face materials that fit the block format.":`用于受支持的块和适合块格式的每面材质。`,"Use for supported custom block models and their per-face assignments.":`用于支持的自定义块模型及其每面分配。`,"Use for supported meshes or objects that need more than one active texture.":`用于受支持的网格体或需要多个活动纹理的对象。`,"Use it for":`使用它`,"Use it to":`用它来`,"Use local console commands and logs to inspect results or diagnose failures.":`使用本地控制台命令和日志来检查结果或诊断故障。`,"Use Merge Dimensions only when the target Bedrock build supports the generated custom dimensions and Script API requirements. Keep an ordinary world copy if you want a simpler import or need to compare results.":`仅当目标 Bedrock 构建支持生成的自定义尺寸和脚本 API 要求时,才使用合并尺寸。如果您想要更简单的导入或需要比较结果,请保留普通的世界副本。`,"Use orbit for a composed exterior view and the first-person camera to work at ground level.":`使用轨道拍摄合成的外部视图,并使用第一人称相机在地面工作。`,"Use Packet Inspector to review an authorized recording locally and document what the recording supports.":`使用Packet Inspector 在本地查看授权录制并记录录制支持的内容。

当该维度存在时,`,"Use point, spot, and area sources alongside supported Minecraft light inputs.":`使用点光源、点光源和面光源以及受支持的 Minecraft 光输入。`,"Use render3d with a prepared asset catalog and a Bedrock world folder.":`将 render3d 与准备好的资源目录和基岩世界文件夹结合使用。`,"Use the Archive workspace to inspect or export available snapshot files.":`使用存档工作区检查或导出可用的快照文件。`,"Use the capture command or record alongside another proxy command.":`使用捕获命令或与另一个代理命令一起记录。`,"Use the CLI artifact for the OS and architecture. Run help from that executable.":`使用操作系统和架构的CLI 工件。从该可执行文件运行帮助。`,"Use the CLI executable for your system. The examples show Windows PowerShell. Replace `Craft-Box.exe` with the filename from your release. On Linux and macOS, mark the file executable with `chmod +x` and run it from its directory using `./` and its actual filename.":"使用适合您系统的CLI 可执行文件。示例显示 Windows PowerShell。将 `Craft-Box.exe` 替换为您版本中的文件名。在 Linux 和 macOS 上,使用 `chmod +x` 标记文件可执行文件,并使用 `./` 及其实际文件名从其目录运行它。","Use the console to review output, completion, and command history.":`使用控制台查看输出、完成情况和命令历史记录。`,"Use the corresponding capture workspace or CLI command.":`使用相应的捕获工作空间或CLI 命令。`,"Use the Desktop artifact for the OS and architecture and confirm its native web runtime is present.":`使用操作系统和架构的桌面工件,并确认其本机 Web 运行时是否存在。`,"Use the desktop console":`使用桌面控制台`,"Use the export settings for a completed world to preview what will be copied. Rules can retain or exclude dimensions, crop along inclusive chunk bounds, and replace supported biome IDs. Keep the captured original as the source for a full-world export.":`使用已完成世界的导出设置来预览将复制的内容。规则可以保留或排除维度、沿着包含块边界裁剪以及替换支持的生物群系 ID。保留捕获的原件作为全球导出的来源。`,"Use the eyedropper to inspect the current block state and its available NBT type. Custom states may need explicit type selection.":`使用吸管检查当前方块状态及其可用的NBT类型。自定义状态可能需要显式类型选择。`,"Use the help output from your executable as the authority for commands and flags. Preview and Stable can differ.":`使用可执行文件的帮助输出作为命令和标志的权限。预览版和稳定版可能有所不同。`,"Use the local console to narrow the evidence":`使用本地控制台缩小证据范围`,"Use the merge command with saved world inputs.":`使用合并命令与已保存的世界输入。`,"Use the picker or the searchable palette. Custom identifiers and states can be entered in the inspector.":`使用选择器或可搜索调色板。可以在检查器中输入自定义标识符和状态。`,"Use the result-folder action on a world or the destination shown by the export dialog. Choose a separate output location when you want to keep an older export. If the result is missing, check the visit status and the relevant message before starting over.":`在导出对话框显示的世界或目的地上使用结果文件夹操作。当您想要保留较旧的导出时,请选择单独的输出位置。如果结果丢失,请在重新开始之前检查访问状态和相关消息。`,"Use the shot lane for cuts and source ranges when working with several cameras.":`使用多个摄像机时,使用镜头通道进行剪辑和源范围。`,"Use the timestamp and the component around the failed action.":`使用时间戳和失败操作周围的组件。`,"Use the Y control to select a level. Isolate reveals internal surfaces on that layer; Adjacent gives neighboring layers enough visibility to keep context. The 2D layer view includes a block legend and movable X/Z viewing window.":`使用 Y 控件选择级别。隔离显示该层的内表面;相邻为相邻层提供了足够的可见性以保持上下文。 2D 图层视图包括块图例和可移动的 X/Z 查看窗口。`,"Use void, flat, or normal generation for uncaptured terrain.":`对未占领的地形使用虚空、平坦或正常生成。`,"Use when several active textures or polygon mesh data make the specific Bedrock format unsuitable.":`当多个活动纹理或多边形网格数据使特定基岩格式不适合时使用。`,"Use when the source entity fits a compatible texture and cube layout.":`当源实体适合兼容的纹理和立方体布局时使用。`,"Uses the selected object’s source binding to choose a suitable project type.":`使用所选对象的源绑定来选择合适的项目类型。`,UTC:`世界标准时间`,Variant:`类型`,"Verified behavior and limitations":`已验证的行为和限制`,"Verify a copy before moving on":`在继续之前验证副本`,"Verify a short video range first":`先验证短视频范围`,"Verify coverage before treating the cell as air.":`在将电池视为空气之前验证覆盖范围。`,"Verify terrain coverage and the expected textures in CraftBox.":`验证地形覆盖范围和CraftBox 中的预期纹理。`,Version:`版本`,"Version {0} is unavailable in this channel. Choose another version or check GitHub.":`版本{0} 在此频道中不可用。选择其他版本或勾选GitHub。`,"Version and identifier comparison":`版本和标识符比较`,"Video and audio output options depend on the desktop runtime and selected format.":`视频和音频输出选项取决于桌面运行时和所选格式。`,"Video and GIF":`视频和 GIF`,"Video encoders":`视频编码器`,"View GitHub releases":`在 GitHub 上查看版本`,"View implementation":`查看实现`,"View on GitHub":`在GitHub查看`,"View source":`查看源码`,"Visible portion of the editor preview":`编辑器预览的可见部分`,Void:`虚空`,"Water rendering":`水渲染`,"Website imagery comes from the":`网站图片来自`,"What a visit can preserve":`一次访问可以保留什么`,"What an import can contain":`导入可以包含什么`,"What it can tell you":`它能告诉你什么`,"What it controls":`它控制什么`,"What still needs to exist":`还需要存在什么`,"What the project can retain":`项目可以保留什么`,"What to check":`检查什么`,"What to confirm":`确认什么`,"What to expect":`期待什么`,"What to keep":`保留什么`,"What to review":`复习什么`,"What you can do":`你能做什么`,"What you can make":`你能做什么`,"When it fits":`合适时`,"When moving between installations, record the CraftBox version, channel, OS, Bedrock version, world format, and pack dependencies. Transport support relates to connecting, while import and render fidelity depend on saved data and available definitions.":`在安装之间移动时,记录 CraftBox 版本、频道、操作系统、基岩版本、世界格式和包依赖项。传输支持与连接相关,而导入和渲染保真度则取决于保存的数据和可用的定义。`,"Where to verify":`哪里验证`,Windows:`Windows`,"Windows Desktop":`Windows 桌面`,"Windows Desktop WebView2":`Windows 桌面 WebView2`,"Windows, Linux, and macOS builds.":`Windows、Linux 和 macOS 版本。`,"Windows, Linux, and macOS desktop builds run the Wails and React workspaces.":`Windows、Linux 和 macOS 桌面版本运行 Wails 和 React 工作区。`,"Work on a build layer by layer":`逐层构建`,"Work one layer at a time":`一次工作一层`,"Work with imported skins or available recorded appearances. Save a texture edit or export a supported model.":`使用导入的皮肤或可用的录制外观。保存纹理编辑或导出支持的模型。`,"Work with received tiles and saved regions. Export an annotated PNG or a composed Bedrock world.":`使用接收到的图块和保存的区域。导出带注释的 PNG 或组合的基岩世界。`,"Work with several tabs":`使用多个选项卡`,Workflow:`工作流程`,"Workflow steps":`工作流程步骤`,Workflows:`工作流程`,"Workspace keyboard shortcuts":`工作区键盘快捷键`,"World capture":`世界捕获`,"World capture and connections":`世界捕获与连接`,"World capture is limited to data the client received. Custom blocks, actor models, materials, and previews depend on the source assets and their readable definitions. Protected data may require the original files and account entitlement.":`世界捕获仅限于客户端收到的数据。自定义块、参与者模型、材质和预览取决于源资产及其可读定义。受保护的数据可能需要原始文件和帐户权限。`,"World capture options":`世界捕获选项`,"World command options":`世界命令选项`,"World copy preview and export implementation":`世界副本预览和导出实现`,"World data can include signs. No comparable textured scene-export pipeline was found.":`世界数据可以包含标志。没有找到类似的纹理场景导出管道。`,"World overview":`世界概览`,"World viewer and model export":`世界查看器和模型导出`,"World-to-render demo":`世界渲染演示`,"World, pack, and skin modes":`世界、包和皮肤模式`,"Worlds & maps":`世界和地图`,"Worlds overview":`世界概览`,"Worlds, projects, and outputs":`世界、项目和输出`,"Write a top-down image with the world output.":`用世界输出编写一个自上而下的图像。`,"Write down the app version, operating system, source category, selected workflow, and the last successful step. Keep the timestamp and time zone so someone can find the relevant events in a log.":`记下应用程序版本、操作系统、源类别、所选工作流程以及最后成功的步骤。保留时间戳和时区,以便有人可以在日志中找到相关事件。`,"Wrong or missing texture":`纹理错误或缺失`,"Y-up convention and supported glTF material properties. GLB is a convenient single file.":`Y 向上约定并支持 glTF 材料属性。 GLB 是一个方便的单个文件。`,"You can link a Microsoft account through the desktop device-code screen or continue offline. Start offline for importing local worlds, rendering, browsing imported packs, or reopening a saved project. Link the account before starting a supported online capture that uses its server, Realm, Experience, or friends access.":`您可以通过桌面设备代码屏幕链接Microsoft帐户或继续离线。离线开始导入本地世界、渲染、浏览导入的包或重新打开已保存的项目。在开始使用其服务器、领域、体验或朋友访问权限的受支持的在线捕获之前链接帐户。`,"Zoom around the pointer to keep your point of interest in view. Hover for coordinates, copy a location, or jump to an exact position. Pick a position to open the corresponding area in 3D where supported.":`围绕指针进行缩放以保持您感兴趣的点在视图中。将鼠标悬停以获取坐标、复制位置或跳转到确切位置。选择一个位置,在支持的情况下打开相应的 3D 区域。`,"CraftBox is maintained by SpindexGFX and builds on {0}. The original maintainers and contributors are credited in the desktop project.":`CraftBox 由 SpindexGFX 维护，基于 {0} 开发。桌面版项目中列出了原项目的维护者和贡献者。`,"Website imagery comes from the {0} and {1}. Documented examples include work from The Hive and CubeCraft Games.":`网站图片来自{0}和{1}。文档中的示例包括 The Hive 和 CubeCraft Games 的作品。`,"CraftBox is distributed under {0}. Bundled third-party components retain their own notices.":`CraftBox 根据 {0} 分发。随附的第三方组件保留各自的声明。`,"The website uses {0} icons by Fonticons, Inc. under {1}. Icon colors follow the site theme.":`网站使用 Fonticons, Inc. 提供的 {0} 图标，遵循 {1} 许可。图标颜色随网站主题变化。`,"For code and documentation contributions, follow the {0}.":`如需贡献代码或文档，请参阅{0}。`,"Copy page link":`复制页面链接`,"Page link":`页面链接`};export{e as default};